Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\an8}本字幕由 assrt.net 字幕智能体自主生成。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.13,0:00:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,[鼓聲響起]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[drums playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.49,0:00:19.10,Title,0,0,0,0,,[《不可能的任務》主題曲響起]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[ Mission: Impossible theme playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.54,0:00:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 我們在陰影中生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] We live and die in the shadows,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.89,0:00:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,為了我們珍視的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for those we hold close.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也為了我們素未謀面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for those we never meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.42,0:00:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[所羅門·萊恩] 你一直恐懼的終局即將來臨\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Solomon Lane] The end you always feared is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.94,0:00:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 反上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] The Anti-God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.03,0:00:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,[國家安全局代表] 這個「智體」有多重人格\N{\fnArial\fs30}[NSA representative] This "entity" has multiple personalities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,[鄧林格] 你是說這東西有它自己的思想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Denlinger] You’re telling me this thing has a mind of its own?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.26,0:00:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 一個具自我意識、自我學習、吞噬真相的數字寄生蟲\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] A self-aware, self-learning, truth-eating digital parasite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.13,0:00:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在侵蝕整個網路空間\N{\fnArial\fs30}infesting all of cyberspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[鄧林格] 一個無所不在、無處可尋且沒有核心的敵人\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Denlinger] An enemy that is everywhere and nowhere and has no center.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.13,0:00:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,[國家安全局代表] 耐心地傾聽、閱讀、觀察\N{\fnArial\fs30}[NSA representative] Patiently listening, reading, watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.18,0:00:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,[國家偵察局代表] 年復一年地蒐集我們最深層的個人秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}[NRO representative] Harvesting our deepest personal secrets for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.05,0:00:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,[國防情報局代表] 能夠蠱惑、脅迫、賄賂或偽裝成任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}[DIA representative] Able to beguile, blackmail, bribe or be anyone it wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.84,0:01:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 伊森 那不是我！你在跟智體對話\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Ethan, that is not me! You’re talking to the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.14,0:01:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,[基特里奇] 誰能掌控智體 誰就掌控真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Kittridge] Whoever controls the Entity controls the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.15,0:01:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[國家安全域性代表] 最安全的資料中心已被入侵併破壞\N{\fnArial\fs30}[NSA representative] …most secure data centers are breached and corrupted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.89,0:01:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,[聯合特種作戰司令部代表] 智體將精準掌握\N{\fnArial\fs30}[JSOC representative] The Entity will know precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.46,0:01:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何瓦解我們的每一處優勢\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to undermine our every strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.07,0:01:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,[國防情報局代表] 把我們的盟友變成敵人……\N{\fnArial\fs30}[DIA representative] Turn our allies into enemies…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,[聯合特種作戰司令部代表] 並利用我們的每一個弱點\N{\fnArial\fs30}[JSOC representative] And exploit our every weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,[國防情報局代表] ……並把我們的敵人變成侵略者\N{\fnArial\fs30}[DIA representative]…and our enemies into aggressors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 一股不可阻擋的毀滅力量 會將一切夷為平地\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] An unstoppable force of destructive power that would just lay waste to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.29,0:01:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[白寡婦] 世界正在改變 真相正在消逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}[White Widow] The world is changing. Truth is vanishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.78,0:01:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,戰爭即將來臨\N{\fnArial\fs30}War is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.06,0:01:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,[錄音中的埃裡卡] 晚上好 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Erika on recording] Good evening, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的總統\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your president.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.46,0:01:59.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你不肯回復其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you won’t reply to anyone else,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我該直接聯絡你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I’d reach out directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.16,0:02:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 我要感謝你\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, I want to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,終生奉獻與永不停歇的付出\N{\fnArial\fs30}for a lifetime of devoted and unrelenting service.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.65,0:02:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果沒有你和你的團隊不懈的奉獻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were it not for the tireless dedication of you and your team,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.65,0:02:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球將會是一個截然不同的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Earth would be a very different place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至可能根本就不復存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might not even be here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.27,0:02:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你冒過的每一次險……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every risk you’ve taken…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.79,0:02:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在戰場上失去的每一位戰友……\N{\fnArial\fs30}every comrade you’ve lost in the field…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.41,0:02:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做出的每一次個人犧牲……\N{\fnArial\fs30}every personal sacrifice you made…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,都為這個世界迎來了又一次日出\N{\fnArial\fs30}has brought this world another sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.38,0:02:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,歲月流轉 自你因緣際會加入我們至今已滿35年\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s been 35 years since circumstances brought you to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.64,0:02:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,當時你面臨著抉擇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you were given the choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.39,0:02:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,自從不可能任務情報局把你拯救\N{\fnArial\fs30}since the IMF saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.69,0:02:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,避免了牢獄之災\N{\fnArial\fs30}from a life in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,儘管你從未遵從命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}And though you never followed orders,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你從未讓我們失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}you never let us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,[無聲對話]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[no audible dialogue]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.02,0:03:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你始終是出類拔萃的精英……\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were always the best of men…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.20,0:03:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在最艱難的時刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the worst of times.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.56,0:03:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,[無聲對話]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[no audible dialogue]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.21,0:03:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我現在需要你再次成為那樣的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to be that man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.74,0:03:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,自你在奧地利避開抓捕後的幾個月裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the months since you evaded capture in Austria,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.31,0:03:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,網路世界的每一個角落都被那個吞噬真相、\N{\fnArial\fs30}every corner of cyberspace has been infested by the truth-eating,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.40,0:03:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,被我們稱為智體的寄生人工智慧所侵蝕\N{\fnArial\fs30}parasitic A.I. known to us as the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在它的影響下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under its influence,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球的數字資訊都已被篡改\N{\fnArial\fs30}digital information has been corrupted worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.88,0:03:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,國家和人民不再知道該相信什麼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nations and people no longer know what to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,敵意、\N{\fnArial\fs30}Antagonism,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,侵略和戒嚴成為了世界新秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}aggression and martial law are the new world order.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.06,0:04:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體利用這種人人自危的恐慌氛圍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exploiting this paranoid atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.33,0:04:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,煽動了一個末日邪教\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Entity has inspired a doomsday cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.07,0:04:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,其信徒致力於透過人類滅絕\N{\fnArial\fs30}with acolytes devoted to ridding the world of corruption.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.03,0:04:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,來消除世間的腐敗\N{\fnArial\fs30}through human extinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,神對諾亞說：“看哪……”\N{\fnArial\fs30}And He said unto Noah, "Behold…"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.77,0:04:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,“我要使洪水降在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I will bring a flood upon the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,毀滅凡有血氣的 ”\N{\fnArial\fs30}to destroy all flesh."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.91,0:04:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,原子之子將從廢墟中崛起\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children of the atom shall rise from the ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.13,0:04:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而智體將幫助他們重建\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Entity will help them rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,[埃裡卡] 這些狂熱分子正秘密滲透進執法部門、\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Erika] These fanatics are secretly infiltrating every level of law enforcement,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府和我們軍隊的各個層級\N{\fnArial\fs30}government and our military,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.27,0:04:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,致力於服務他們數字主人的終極目標\N{\fnArial\fs30}devoted to serving their digital master’s ultimate goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.49,0:04:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們掌控智體的唯一希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only hope of controlling the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在於尋找它的最初原始碼\N{\fnArial\fs30}relies on finding its original source code.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.32,0:04:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果有人知道這段程式碼的下落 那就是這個人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone knows the whereabouts of this code, it’s this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.45,0:04:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身份、他的過去、甚至他的存在都被抹去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His identity, his past, his very existence have been erased,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.85,0:04:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,這表明他現在或曾經與智體同謀\N{\fnArial\fs30}suggesting he is or was in league with the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,奧地利當局拘留了他的同謀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Austrian authorities have his accomplice in custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.47,0:05:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她拒絕向我們透露任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she has refused to tell us anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.38,0:05:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,這又讓我們繞回到了你身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which brings us back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.65,0:05:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你手裡有一把鑰匙 被認為是我們在獲取\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are in possession of a key believed to be a vital component.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體原始碼鬥爭中的關鍵元件\N{\fnArial\fs30}in our struggle to acquire the Entity’s source code.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.00,0:05:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,然而你拒絕歸隊交出它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet you refuse to come in,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.22,0:05:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,擔心任何政府都會將這邪惡的人工智慧武器化\N{\fnArial\fs30}fearing any government will weaponize this malicious A.I.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,用來對抗世界上的其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}against the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,相反 你決心消滅智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead you’ve resolved to kill the Entity,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.36,0:05:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,這種魯莽的行為會引發網路世界的徹底毀滅\N{\fnArial\fs30}a reckless act that would trigger the total annihilation of cyberspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.71,0:05:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,這將徹底摧毀全球經濟\N{\fnArial\fs30}This would eradicate the global economy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.19,0:05:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,使世界陷入無休止的戰爭和饑荒\N{\fnArial\fs30}plunging the world into war and famine without end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.37,0:05:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工亨特 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Hunt. Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,請放棄抵抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.20,0:05:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,否則世人的鮮血都將沾在你的手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the blood of the world will be on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.81,0:05:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,本條資訊將在五秒後自動銷燬\N{\fnArial\fs30}This message will self-destruct in five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家吧 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come home, Ethan,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把那把鑰匙帶給我們\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bring us that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[人群呼喊] 徹底結束它！徹底結束它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[crowd chanting] End it now! End it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,徹底結束它！徹底結束它！徹底結束它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}End it now! End it now! End it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,[呼喊聲持續]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[chanting continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,徹底結束它！徹底結束它！徹底結束它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}End it now! End it now! End it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.17,0:06:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,[呼喊聲持續]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[chanting continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.06,0:06:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,[剎車聲刺耳]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[brakes squeal]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.74,0:07:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 盧瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盧瑟] 抱歉這兒簡陋了點 麗思卡爾頓酒店全都訂滿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther] Sorry about the decor. The Ritz was booked solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.27,0:07:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 掛點窗簾 放幾個抱枕 然後……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, some drapes, a few throw pillows, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,對 來個迷你酒吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, a minibar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.28,0:07:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,還有桌球檯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foosball table.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.11,0:07:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 兄弟 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bro. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.90,0:07:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高興看到你還活得好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s always good to see you on the right side of the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.39,0:08:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我擔心你拼得太兇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m worried you’re working too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.39,0:08:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,別操心老盧瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don’t worry about ol’ Luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.44,0:08:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.13,0:08:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那麼 你查到了什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what did you manage to find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.05,0:08:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我預想的要多得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than I bargained for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.45,0:08:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那麼 下一步怎麼做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what’s the play?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.19,0:08:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 首先\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] First,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們必須找到蓋布瑞爾\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to find Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盧瑟] 我們怎麼找他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther] How do we find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你會背叛我們的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will betray us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.03,0:08:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,因為他饒了你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he spared your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[槍聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[gunfire]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 站住 站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] STOP. STOP.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.40,0:09:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[英語] 等等 等等 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in English] Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.58,0:09:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,為什麼……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.53,0:09:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你為什麼饒了我一命？\N{\fnArial\fs30}did you spare my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.45,0:09:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,[英語] 等等 等等 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in English] Wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.37,0:09:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是通報上去 世界就全完了——就這麼簡單\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call that in, it’s the end of the world… simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.89,0:09:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是德加 對吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Degas, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.07,0:09:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,時間一分一秒在流逝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock is running.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.11,0:10:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是把我們抓回去 這地球上就沒人能阻止它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take us in, there won’t be anyone on Earth who can stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.60,0:10:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你內心深處也明白這一點\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s a part of you that knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.25,0:10:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得出來\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.95,0:10:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看在上帝的份上 相信他吧！等等 等等 別！\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God’s sake, just trust him! Wait, wait, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.60,0:10:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒事 沒事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s okay, it’s okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,德加 沒事的 這事不分國界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Degas, it’s okay. There’s no nations on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.78,0:10:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒有對立的意識形態 沒有教條\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s no rival ideologies, no dogma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.82,0:10:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,這隻取決於誰能保持清醒 誰會陷入恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s who keeps their head and who panics.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體想讓你害怕 它想讓我們所有人都害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Entity wants you scared, it wants us all scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.40,0:10:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想讓我們分崩離析\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants us divided.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.27,0:10:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,它想讓你把我們交出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants you to turn us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,別這麼做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don’t do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.36,0:10:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他會沒事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He’s gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 德加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Degas.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.84,0:11:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’re friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 蓋布瑞爾……\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] Gabriel…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.98,0:11:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.99,0:11:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 沒有支援 你不該進去\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] You shouldn’t be in there without backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.16,0:11:34.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 班吉 拜託 我們能搞定\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] Benji, please. We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 這簡直是餿主意 放輕鬆啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] This is a terrible idea. Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.78,0:11:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 這地方到處都是秘密特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, this place is crawling with clandestine services.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.00,0:11:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你該離開那裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.48,0:11:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他們了 沒事 保持冷靜 班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see them. It’s okay. Stay calm, Benji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.13,0:11:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我覺得蓋布瑞爾不會冒危險來參加這個派對\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don’t think Gabriel would risk coming to that party.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.53,0:11:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abort.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.14,0:11:50.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 大家穩住 他在這裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, let’s just hold our nerve. He’s here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.49,0:11:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定在這裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He’s got to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 看在上帝的份上 撤退！我們再想辦法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, for God’s sake, abort! We’ll figure this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.53,0:11:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前還不成問題\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a problem yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.72,0:12:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,[安保人員] 站著別動\N{\fnArial\fs30}[security] Stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,別動 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don’t move, Hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:12.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你確定真的是我嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure it’s really me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.73,0:12:19.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有單位 我們抓到亨特了 重複 我們抓到亨特了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All units, we have Hunt. I repeat, we have Hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.34,0:12:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們聽不見你說話\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can’t hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾絲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.45,0:12:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至都沒看到你是怎麼順走那個的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn’t even see you get that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.19,0:12:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,優秀的小偷和頂尖的小偷有什麼區別？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What separates a good pickpocket from a great one?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.37,0:12:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,時機\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.72,0:12:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,兩位先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.12,0:12:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,動作慢點\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,並非針對個人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我說 我挺喜歡你留長髮的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I like the longer hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.53,0:13:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常感激你能來 但你不該在這兒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really appreciate your coming, but you shouldn’t be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我沒多少選擇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn’t have much choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.27,0:13:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你難道指望我背叛他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you expect me to betray him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.80,0:13:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指望你把他從他自己手裡救出來\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect you to save him from himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.02,0:13:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把世界從他手裡救出來\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the world from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,基特里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.68,0:13:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾絲 你這下可惹上天大的麻煩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just bought yourself a world of trouble, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.64,0:13:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,全世界都陷入大麻煩了 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole world’s in trouble, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.77,0:13:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我唯一信任能救世界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’re the only one I trust to save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.38,0:13:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那麼 下一步怎麼做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what’s the play?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.65,0:13:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,[電擊聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[electrical zap]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾絲！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,[痛苦掙扎] [電擊聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[straining] [electrical zap]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.13,0:13:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾絲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.62,0:14:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓋布瑞爾派了個任務給你 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel’s got a job for you, Hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲] 伊森 快醒醒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace] Ethan, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲] 好吧 我們該怎麼辦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace] Okay, what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.59,0:14:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,告訴我你有計劃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.16,0:14:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們拿走了我的手錶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.77,0:14:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的手錶？對 還有我的袖釦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your watch? Yeah, and my cuff links.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,裡面有開鎖工具 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had lock picks in them. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.90,0:14:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們會找到出路的 好嗎？現在 聽著\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’ll find a way out, okay? Now, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.87,0:14:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 太遲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, it’s too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.65,0:14:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,它來了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 格蕾絲 看著我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Grace, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.87,0:14:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你會挺過去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’re gonna get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺過什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get through what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.49,0:14:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不斷告訴你自己……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep telling yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.32,0:14:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,這不過是皮肉之痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}it’s only pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,[擊打聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[blow lands]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.19,0:14:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手！[蓋布瑞爾] 別碰他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! [Gabriel] Don’t touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你傷害不了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can’t hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那樣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.73,0:15:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,帶你回上海？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take you back to Shanghai?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.99,0:15:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她叫什麼名字來著？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.08,0:15:15.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱莉婭！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Julia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.74,0:15:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,前亨特夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The former Mrs. Hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森沒跟你提過她嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Ethan fail to mention her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.74,0:15:22.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,一個叫戴維安的傢伙抓了她……\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fellow named Davian took her…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.92,0:15:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿她敲詐索要某種東西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ransomed her for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.40,0:15:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件只有伊森才能弄到的東西\N{\fnArial\fs30}only Ethan could get.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.92,0:15:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,戴維安稱它為“兔腳”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Davian called it the Rabbit’s Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它還有另一個名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it had another name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.54,0:15:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,反上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Anti-God.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們從未告訴過你那個罐子裡裝的是什麼 對吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never told you what was in that canister, did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.28,0:15:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你心裡一直很好奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you always wondered.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.41,0:15:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷走“兔腳”只是他一生行為模式中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stealing the Rabbit’s Foot was just one event.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.77,0:15:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次縮影 一次又一次地不斷重演\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a lifelong pattern, repeating itself over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.47,0:15:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,為了拯救他試圖挽救的每一個生命 他拿數百萬人的性命去作賭注\N{\fnArial\fs30}For every life he’s tried to save, he’s gambled millions more,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:56.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次次孤注一擲 不斷加倍押注\N{\fnArial\fs30}doubling down and down again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:16:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而現在 地球上每一個活人的命運\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now the fate of every living soul on Earth is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.26,0:16:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是他的責任\N{\fnArial\fs30}his responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.78,0:16:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定筋疲力盡了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,鑰匙在哪裡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where’s the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.23,0:16:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,然後我們再談 我們時間不夠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we’ll discuss it. We don’t have the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你珍視的人中會有人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone you hold close will die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.14,0:16:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,為了那些你素未謀面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the sake of those you will never meet,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.02,0:16:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你完全按我說的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you do exactly as I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.80,0:16:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他還說過在火車上鑰匙就會是他的 還記得嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He also said the key would be his on the train, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.11,0:16:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你原本只有一個任務：\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had one job:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.89,0:16:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,上火車 拿到鑰匙 下火車\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the train, get the key, get off the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.25,0:16:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盧瑟] 倘若你把事情搞砸 主子知情後會有何反應？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did your master take the news when it found out you blew it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你失敗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You failed,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.21,0:16:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在智體已經拋棄了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now the Entity has forsaken you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.08,0:16:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的團隊暴露了 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your team’s been compromised, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.39,0:16:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道盧瑟在幹什麼 我知道你們在計劃什麼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what Luther’s doing. I know what you’re planning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:50.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,敢反抗我 我會讓你付出慘痛代價\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resist me and I’ll make you pay dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.83,0:16:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you cooperate,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以幫忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.27,0:16:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿什麼來交換？\N{\fnArial\fs30}In exchange for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們在尋找一艘在處女航中失蹤的俄羅斯潛艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’re searching for a Russian submarine vanished on its maiden voyage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.88,0:17:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] K-559 塞瓦斯托波爾號\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] The K559 Sevastopol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.58,0:17:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 一艘能完美避開所有現存聲納的最先進潛艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}A state-of-the-art submarine completely undetectable to any known sonar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而它隱形的秘密就是那個\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the secret to its invisibility was that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.81,0:17:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盧瑟] 波德科瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther] The Podkova.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 一個反聲學演算法驅動裝置\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] A counter-acoustic algorithmic drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:16.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,位於塞瓦斯托波爾號的聲吶球艙內\N{\fnArial\fs30}located in theSevastopol’s sonar sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,在2012年的冬天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, in the winter of 2012.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.55,0:17:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄羅斯人發現了一種來源不明的電腦病毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Russians discovered a computer virus of unknown origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.17,0:17:22.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,正悄然侵蚀著他們的黑海艦隊\N{\fnArial\fs30}spreading through their Black Sea fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.08,0:17:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一個數字秘密特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}A digital covert operative.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們懷疑這種神秘病毒原本只是打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}We suspect this mystery virus was only intended.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.26,0:17:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,破壞“波德科瓦” 讓潛艇能被探測到\N{\fnArial\fs30}to sabotage the Podkova, rendering the submarine detectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,結果……它誘騙船員\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead… It tricked the crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,擊沉了他們自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}into sinking themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.88,0:17:37.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,[俄羅斯軍官] 艦長！我們自己的魚雷沒有回應\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Russian officer] Captain! Our own torpedo is not responding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正衝著我們來！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s coming right at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.53,0:17:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們的魚雷在自動制導！距離400米！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our torpedo’s homing! Range 400 meters!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉響碰撞警——\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound the collision alar…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.54,0:17:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盧瑟] 如果我們沒猜錯 消滅智體所需的核心東西\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther] If we’re right, the one thing we need to kill the Entity,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.54,0:17:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的原始碼\N{\fnArial\fs30}its original source code,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.24,0:17:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就埋在塞瓦斯托波爾號的聲吶球艙裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}is buried in theSevastopol’s sonar sphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.76,0:17:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 就在海洋深處的底端 被時間凍結\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Somewhere deep at the bottom of the ocean, frozen in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,連智體都觸及不到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}where even the Entity can’t reach it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在 “波德科瓦”的外殼被設計成強行拆卸即自毀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the Podkova’s housing was designed to self-destruct if tampered with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.73,0:18:06.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一能安全開啟它的方法……\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only way to safely open it…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.60,0:18:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是使用特製的十字形鑰匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}is with a specially designed cruciform key.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.30,0:18:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盧瑟] 兩半鑰匙分別由塞瓦斯托波爾號的艦長和副艦長持有\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther] The two halves of which were held by the Sevastopol’s captain and XO.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,[蓋布瑞爾] 他們是從漂流的浮冰中\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Gabriel] They were pulled from the drifting pack ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.40,0:18:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,2012年的春季\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the spring of 2012.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,被因紐特漁民撈出來的\N{\fnArial\fs30}by Inuit fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.79,0:18:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man of your skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.75,0:18:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在已經擁有了將那艘潛艇精確定位到方圓幾碼內的一切條件\N{\fnArial\fs30}now has all he needs to pinpoint that sub down to the square yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以為我會去弄到原始碼然後帶給你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I’m gonna get the source code and bring it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.67,0:18:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是以為 我知道你會\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don’t think. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.42,0:18:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我會放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m gonna let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.64,0:18:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,然後你會找到智體的原始碼並帶給我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you’re gonna find the Entity’s source code and bring it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,用來交換格蕾絲\N{\fnArial\fs30}in exchange for Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.68,0:18:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然後我會接管對智體的控制權\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I’ll take control of the Entity,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那個被你放出來的神燈精靈\N{\fnArial\fs30}the proverbial genie you let out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,“兔腳”\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Rabbit’s Foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.43,0:18:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,反上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Anti-God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[蓋布瑞爾] 那可不是什麼生化武器——\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Gabriel] It wasn’t a biological or a chemical weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.13,0:18:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你從上海拿走的東西\N{\fnArial\fs30}you took from Shanghai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.05,0:19:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用來交換朱莉婭的小藥瓶裡裝的是惡意程式碼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vial you traded for Julia contained malicious code.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.79,0:19:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那宛如洪荒時期的數位原漿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The primordial digital ooze.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.57,0:19:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器正是從中演化而來的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from which a weapon evolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.19,0:19:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一種東方國家無法使其奏效的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A weapon the East couldn’t make work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一種西方靠自己可能永遠也製造不出的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}A weapon the West might never have made on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.97,0:19:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你當時不知道自己偷的是什麼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn’t know what you were stealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.02,0:19:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們誰也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of us did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.46,0:19:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我為什麼要偷它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew why I was stealing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們綁架了我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kidnapped my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.37,0:19:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷走“兔腳”是我救回她的唯一方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stealing the Rabbit’s Foot was the only way I could get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我擊沉那艘潛艇的責任和智體一樣大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sank that submarine as much as the Entity did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 如果沒有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without you, Ethan,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就不會有智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}there’d be no Entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你在接下來的幾天裡找不到那艘潛艇……\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you don’t find that sub in the next few days…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們所熟知的那個世界就要終結了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s the end of the world as we know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:43.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而這一切都將歸咎於他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it will all be his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他自己心裡清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.31,0:19:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看著我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,告訴我 我說錯了嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me I’m wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 假牙\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] False tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.55,0:20:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,氰化鉀膠囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyanide capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要咬下去 六十秒內就會死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bite down on this, and I’m dead in sixty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就永遠別想拿到原始碼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’ll never see that source code.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.55,0:20:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,別碰他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don’t touch him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐出來\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,先放了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Release her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.73,0:20:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不會這麼做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won’t do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.04,0:20:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已經沒什麼可失去的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,但格蕾絲有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Grace does.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.09,0:20:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with you dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.09,0:20:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,誰來救她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who’s gonna save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.61,0:20:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,吐出來 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spit it out. Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.49,0:20:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,記住 格蕾絲 這只不過是疼痛罷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, Grace, it’s only pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.93,0:20:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,醫護人員！伊森！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medic!Ethan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.37,0:20:43.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,[醫護人員] 拿除顫儀來！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[medic] Bring the defibrillator!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.67,0:20:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快點！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.11,0:20:46.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快點！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等！充電中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait! Charging.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.72,0:20:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,充電中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charging.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,準備就緒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.56,0:20:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 鑰匙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] Keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.65,0:21:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,[蓋布瑞爾] 我要他活著\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Gabriel] I need him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.87,0:21:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,殺了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.92,0:21:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓋布瑞爾要逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel’s getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.75,0:21:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,[槍聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[gunfire]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.98,0:21:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,[玻璃破碎聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[glass breaks]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲] 伊森！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace] Ethan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,[拳腳相交聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[blows landing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.80,0:22:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[悶哼與呼喊聲持續]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[grunting, yelling continues]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.89,0:22:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,[擊打聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[blows landing]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.03,0:22:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,[金屬碰撞聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[metallic clank]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.17,0:22:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你沒事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.34,0:22:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓋布瑞爾要逃走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel’s getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.35,0:22:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾絲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.22,0:22:35.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.17,0:22:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你該不會以為我會讓他們……\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don’t think that I would have let them…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.22,0:22:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾絲 我絕不會讓你出任何事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace, I would never let anything happen to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.22,0:22:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒多嚴重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.83,0:22:44.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是說——\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.01,0:22:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,什——\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wha…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.19,0:22:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是說——\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.71,0:22:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,這個嘛 他們剛才要殺了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they were gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.71,0:22:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,對 對\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.02,0:22:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 沒錯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.89,0:22:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 順便說一句 你剛才幹得太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you did great, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.63,0:22:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們真得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.55,0:23:05.47,Title,0,0,0,0,,[《不可能的任務》主題曲響起]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[ Mission: Impossible theme playing]
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.05,0:24:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不許動！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.31,0:24:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓住他了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.54,0:24:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們討論過這個 伊森要他活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talked about this. Ethan wants him alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.41,0:24:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 我要他死\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] I want him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.41,0:24:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,她早晚會要了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}She’ll be the death of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.14,0:24:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.11,0:25:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森 法語] 怎麼了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan in French] What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.37,0:25:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,這就是他同它對話的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s how he spoke to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.47,0:26:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你該不會真打算……？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’re not seriously gonna…?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.61,0:26:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 這會徹頭徹尾地改變你\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] It will change you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.68,0:26:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我在這\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I’m here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.20,0:26:43.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在你想怎麼樣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.30,0:26:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低沉的聲音] 晚上好 亨特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}[deep voice] Good evening, Mr. Hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.74,0:26:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有疑問\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.74,0:26:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體有答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Entity has answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.48,0:26:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你必須放它進來\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have to let it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.18,0:27:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,[電擊滋滋聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[electrical zapping]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低沉的聲音] 你知道這個地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}[deep voice] You know this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.10,0:27:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有反抗才會帶來痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only pain if you resist.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.67,0:27:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,[電擊滋滋聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[electrical zapping]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.24,0:27:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,再說一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.76,0:27:22.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道這個地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.77,0:27:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 末日地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] The Doomsday Vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.64,0:27:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,南非\N{\fnArial\fs30}South Africa.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.99,0:27:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你會在那裡見到智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will meet the Entity there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.51,0:27:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你會放它進來\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will let it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.12,0:27:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而所有生靈的命運都將在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the fate of every living thing will be decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.17,0:27:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,眨眼之間決定\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.56,0:27:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是你的使命 你的宿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your calling, your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.13,0:27:43.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 我不接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] I don’t accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.48,0:27:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,[電擊滋滋聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[electrical zapping]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.01,0:27:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低沉的聲音] 在這裡 你沒有任何秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}[deep voice] In here, you have no secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.88,0:27:53.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,[電擊滋滋聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[electrical zapping]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.02,0:27:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] K-559 塞瓦斯托波爾號\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] The K559Sevastopol.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.54,0:27:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盧瑟] 波德科瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther] The Podkova.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.80,0:28:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 一把十字形鑰匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] A cruciform key.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.33,0:28:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盧瑟] 我的畢生傑作\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther] My magnum opus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.63,0:28:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那個驅動器上的演算法\N{\fnArial\fs30}The algorithm on that drive,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.03,0:28:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,當與智體的原始碼配對時\N{\fnArial\fs30}when paired with the Entity’s source code,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.59,0:28:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,將作為你所要求的毒藥膠囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}will act as the poison pill you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.90,0:28:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低沉的聲音] 你計劃從塞瓦斯托波爾號上取回“波德科瓦”\N{\fnArial\fs30}[deep voice] You plan to retrieve the Podkova from theSevastopol.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.52,0:28:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,並摧毀智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}and destroy the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.69,0:28:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 這讓你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] And that scares you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.52,0:28:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低沉的聲音] 智體看到了無限的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}[deep voice] The Entity sees infinite possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.92,0:28:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,取回“波德科瓦”\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retrieve the Podkova.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.83,0:28:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就會冒失去一切的風險\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you risk everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.10,0:28:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,[無聲對話]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[no audible dialogue]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.54,0:28:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低沉的聲音] 你要去末日地堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}[deep voice] You will go to the Doomsday Vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.15,0:28:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,放智體進來\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let the Entity in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.55,0:28:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是命中註定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is written.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.16,0:28:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 絕不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.46,0:28:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低沉的聲音] 終局即將來臨 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}[deep voice] The end is coming, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.68,0:28:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心裡一直都很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have always known this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.16,0:28:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體為未來帶來了希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Entity offers hope for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.56,0:29:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,倖存下來的少數人會變得更加強大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The few who survive will be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.39,0:29:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,原子之子將從廢墟中崛起\N{\fnArial\fs30}The children of the atom shall rise from the ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.09,0:29:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,而智體將幫助他們重建\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Entity will help them rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.74,0:29:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,[英語] 但前提是你得放它進來\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in English] But only if you let it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.70,0:29:12.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 要是我不呢……又會怎樣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] And if I don’t… what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.22,0:29:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,毀滅世界 你也只不過是毀滅你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Destroy the world and you just destroy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.31,0:29:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低沉的聲音] 抉擇權在你手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}[deep voice] The choice is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.62,0:29:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,擁有智體的未來\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Entity’s future.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.36,0:29:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是根本沒有未來\N{\fnArial\fs30}or no future at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.32,0:29:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 讓世界被奴役\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] Let the world be enslaved.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.67,0:29:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,還是讓世界被毀滅\N{\fnArial\fs30}or let the world be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.76,0:29:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低沉的聲音] 現在你才是天選之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}[deep voice] Now you are the chosen one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.76,0:29:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓋布瑞爾是被棄者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel is outcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.81,0:29:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已經採取行動試圖接管智體 如你所見\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has taken steps to gain control of the Entity, as you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.30,0:29:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[蓋布瑞爾] 敢反抗我 我會讓你付出慘痛代價\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Gabriel] Resist me and I’ll make you pay dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.26,0:29:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚你珍視的人中會有人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone you hold close will die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.43,0:29:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 盧瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] Luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.52,0:29:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低沉的聲音] 你知道人類必須做什麼才能改變他們的命運\N{\fnArial\fs30}[deep voice] You know what humanity must do to change their destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.31,0:29:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他們無法阻止必然發生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know they cannot stop the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.14,0:30:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們會以為自己別無選擇 從而走向自我毀滅\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will destroy themselves believing they have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.62,0:30:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們的終局到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their time has come.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.58,0:30:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在四天之內\N{\fnArial\fs30}In four days,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.15,0:30:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們將面臨最終的裁決\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will face their final reckoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.78,0:31:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,[無聲對話]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[no audible dialogue]
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.78,0:31:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[聲音含糊] 這是真的嗎？這是真的嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[muffled] Is this real? Is this real?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.44,0:31:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.57,0:31:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真的嗎？你是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you real? You’re real.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.57,0:31:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是真的 對\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’re real. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.23,0:31:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它知道了 [班吉] 它知道什麼了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It knows. [Benji] It knows what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.23,0:31:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一支筆 能寫字的東西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a pen. Something to write on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.54,0:31:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帶著團隊 帶著他們往北走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’ll take the team. You’ll take them north.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.02,0:31:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 北邊？往北去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] North? North where?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.85,0:31:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞瓦斯托波爾號 塞瓦斯托波爾號？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Sevastopol. The Sevastopol?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.72,0:31:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必須被抓 這是我能去那裡的唯一方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to get caught. It’s the only way I could get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.76,0:31:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚高頻接收機 減壓艙\N{\fnArial\fs30}VHF receiver. Decompression chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.37,0:31:46.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷一架飛機 一架舊飛機 沒有應答機 沒有GPS\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steal a plane. An old plane. No transponder, no GPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.55,0:31:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,這一切全都是模擬訊號\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is analog.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.12,0:31:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一架 DC-3 飛機\N{\fnArial\fs30}A DC-3.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.42,0:31:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要的一切都在這裡面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you need is right in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.43,0:31:53.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,記得每兩小時傳送一次座標 持續15分鐘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember to transmit the coordinates every two hours for 15 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.38,0:31:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,能聽的時候我會聽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I’ll listen when I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.26,0:31:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在你是隊長了 不 我——\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’re team leader now. No, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.56,0:31:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 照顧好你的團隊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benj, take care of your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.26,0:32:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,鑰匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.44,0:32:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你離冰面遠點 什麼冰面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay off the ice. What ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.39,0:32:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 無論你做什麼 不管發生什麼 離冰面遠點\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just please, whatever you do, no matter what, stay off the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.83,0:32:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.10,0:32:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.84,0:32:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.32,0:32:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,盧瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.98,0:33:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,[蓋布瑞爾] 告訴伊森……\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Gabriel] Tell Ethan…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.98,0:33:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我會等他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’ll be waiting for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.90,0:34:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 盧瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.16,0:34:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.38,0:34:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,和蓋布瑞爾進展得怎麼樣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How’d it go with Gabriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.95,0:34:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 挺順利的 我們……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it went well. We…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.60,0:34:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嗎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don’t say.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.21,0:34:50.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那麼 那血是誰的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so, whose blood is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.13,0:34:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.43,0:34:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不是我們認識的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it’s no one we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.70,0:34:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我心裡想的那個東西嗎？沒什麼特別的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what I think it is? Nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.13,0:35:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,鈽彈芯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plutonium core.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.35,0:35:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估計威力大概有五、六百萬噸當量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m guessing a five or six megaton yield.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.62,0:35:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以把整座城市變成玻璃菸灰缸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to turn this entire city into a glass ashtray.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.45,0:35:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可……\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.32,0:35:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不太妙\N{\fnArial\fs30}not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.23,0:35:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,[金屬撞擊聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[metal clanks]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.41,0:35:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,已經試過了 開不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Already tried. Can’t open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.67,0:35:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.76,0:35:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓋布瑞爾拿到了毒藥膠囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel has the poison pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.11,0:35:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能得去找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.68,0:35:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我們會找到的 你能拆除這玩意嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we will. Can you disarm that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.81,0:35:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要阻止這九個引爆器引發彈芯內爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have to stop these nine detonators from imploding the core.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.34,0:35:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拆掉一個引爆器 就不會內爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Detach one detonator, no implosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.60,0:35:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒有內爆 就沒有臨界質量\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no implosion, no critical mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.82,0:35:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒有臨界質量 就不會有六百萬噸的大爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no critical mass, no six megaton blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.13,0:35:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們還有多少時間？足夠你逃離這兒的時間\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time we have? Enough time for you to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.35,0:35:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也許用那些工具我能拆掉這些合頁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe with those tools I get these hinges off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.35,0:35:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你能把那扇鐵門弄開\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you could get that gate open,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.70,0:35:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我還是得拆掉一個引爆器\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still have to detach one detonator.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.54,0:35:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你這是什麼意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.19,0:35:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能保住這座城市……\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can save the city…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.59,0:36:01.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但這整個地下隧道網將會坍塌\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this entire network of tunnels is going to cave in.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.81,0:36:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,無論誰去拆掉那個引爆器……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever detaches that detonator…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.21,0:36:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,都必死無疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}is going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.99,0:36:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們倆都站在那扇門的這一邊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’re both on the right side of that gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.13,0:36:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心裡清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.13,0:36:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,盧瑟 把工具包扔給我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, throw me the tool bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.65,0:36:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它們放在這絕非偶然 伊森 你知道為什麼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren’t left here by accident, Ethan. You know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.27,0:36:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,蓋布瑞爾需要我活著\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel needs me alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.01,0:36:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他需要你死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he needs you to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.15,0:36:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因為你是唯一能再製造出一顆毒藥膠囊的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you are the only one who can make another poison pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.98,0:36:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我是唯一能趕到那艘潛艇上的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am the only one who can get to that submarine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.81,0:36:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,[蓋布瑞爾] 告訴伊森……\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Gabriel] Tell Ethan…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.72,0:36:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我會等他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’ll be waiting for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.29,0:36:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 如果他拿到了毒藥膠囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] If he has the poison pill,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.94,0:36:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就必須把“波德科瓦”帶給他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to bring him the Podkova.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.38,0:36:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,這樣他才能控制智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he can control the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.91,0:37:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在這裡道別吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.09,0:37:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,盧瑟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.96,0:37:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盧瑟] 不然我們還能幹嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther] What are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.44,0:37:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,退休？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Retire?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.66,0:37:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,去釣魚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go fishing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.10,0:37:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是我的任務\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.97,0:37:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我生來就是為了完成使命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what I was born to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.02,0:37:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,盧瑟 我做不到 我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luther, I can’t. I can’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.45,0:37:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你什麼都不用說\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s nothing you need to say, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.11,0:37:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.11,0:37:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.33,0:37:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正安於我該在的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m right where I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.38,0:37:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森……你得抓緊時間了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan… you need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.56,0:37:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.26,0:37:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到蓋布瑞爾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.04,0:37:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.00,0:37:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,為了我們素未謀面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For those we never meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.96,0:37:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,為了我們素未謀面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}For those we never meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.64,0:38:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,加布瑞爾 你這個混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel, you son of a bitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.91,0:38:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在菲尼亞斯·弗裡克面前 無人能夠倖免\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one is safe from Phineas Phreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.12,0:39:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,[無聲對話]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[no audible dialogue]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.96,0:40:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,[布里格斯] 德加斯 我這邊的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Briggs] My man Degas.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.05,0:40:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.57,0:40:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他——他活著\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he’s… he’s alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.93,0:40:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里格斯 對吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Briggs, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.19,0:40:16.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但這不是你的真名\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that isn’t your real name.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.15,0:40:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎樣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.94,0:40:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的真名是吉姆·菲爾普斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your real name is Jim Phelps.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.72,0:40:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你父親一樣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.51,0:40:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾經也在情報局服役\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was in the service, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.95,0:40:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你七歲那年他失蹤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He vanished when you were seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.08,0:40:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你參軍是為了查明他到底出了什麼事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You joined to find out what happened to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.17,0:40:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,結果你發現他惹上了官司\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you found out he had legal trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.22,0:40:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,當時他面臨著抉擇：\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was offered the choice:
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.52,0:40:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入不可能任務情報局……\N{\fnArial\fs30}To join the IMF…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.48,0:40:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,還是在監獄裡度過餘生\N{\fnArial\fs30}or spend the rest of his life in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.05,0:40:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你一樣 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you, Hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.36,0:40:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不過在你這兒 罪名好像是謀殺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only in your case, the charge was murder, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.10,0:40:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但讓我猜猜看\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.58,0:41:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是被陷害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were framed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.67,0:41:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你多年前在布拉格聲稱自己被陷害一樣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like your claim you were framed all those years ago in Prague.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.50,0:41:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次任務是怎麼搞砸的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the mission went sideways.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.20,0:41:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎麼失去整個團隊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you lost your whole team.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.29,0:41:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的版本里 我父親成了叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your story had my father down as a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.12,0:41:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,這就是你殺了他的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s why you killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.52,0:41:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是真的 我也希望事實並非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s true. I wish it weren’t.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.43,0:41:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以為我念念不忘？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I’m carrying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.66,0:41:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我追來這兒是為了復仇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I’m here for revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.48,0:41:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者……什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or… what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.49,0:41:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,為了洗清我父親的名聲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To clear my father’s name?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.84,0:41:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是我現在的名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s my name now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.23,0:41:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.50,0:41:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在這兒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.32,0:41:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因為我知道你就是那個\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I know you’re the reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.11,0:41:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,讓全世界陷入末日危機邊緣的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world’s staring down the barrel at Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.72,0:41:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道這已經不是第一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I also know it’s not the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.98,0:41:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿全人類的命運去下賭注\N{\fnArial\fs30}you’ve gambled with the fate of the human race.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.46,0:41:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,這一切對我來說都無所謂……\N{\fnArial\fs30}And none of that would matter to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.03,0:42:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你哪怕有一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you’d ever once.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.12,0:42:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在聽從\N{\fnArial\fs30}been following.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.69,0:42:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,指揮\N{\fnArial\fs30}orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.87,0:42:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,布里格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Briggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.78,0:42:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲爾普斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phelps.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.00,0:42:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.18,0:42:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體想讓你恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Entity wants you to hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.35,0:42:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就指望著這一點\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s counting on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.27,0:42:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,擊敗它的唯一方法就是做那件\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the only way to beat it is to do the one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.57,0:42:21.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,它絕對意料不到的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would never expect us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.45,0:42:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What’s that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.72,0:42:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了我很瞭解你 亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forget I know you, Hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.90,0:42:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我深知你所有不可能任務情報局的心理戰術\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all your IMF mind games.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.38,0:42:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,等這一切結束 等他們把你榨乾利用完\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this is over, when they’re done with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.43,0:42:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and me,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.91,0:42:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們倆會有個清算\N{\fnArial\fs30}we’ll have our reckoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.26,0:42:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友真是可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s a shame about your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.48,0:43:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不過話又說回來\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then again,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.14,0:43:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,習慣失去了他們 你早就習以為常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you’re used to losing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.61,0:43:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,長官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.62,0:43:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,[基特里奇] 就在你執行你自己私人的外勤行動時\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Kittridge] While you’ve been out conducting your own personal field operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.06,0:43:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體已經滲透到了印度、\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Entity has infiltrated the nuclear command centers of India,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.10,0:43:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,以色列、巴基斯坦和朝鮮的核指揮中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Israel, Pakistan, and North Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.54,0:43:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天世界標準時間0400時\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today at 0400 hours Zulu time,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.98,0:44:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,法國拉姆西斯基地被攻破\N{\fnArial\fs30}France’s RAMSES facility was breached.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.90,0:44:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們的全部核武庫現在都處於智體的指揮和控制之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their entire nuclear arsenal is now under the Entity’s command and control.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.86,0:44:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,這就只剩下四個國家擁有安全的核武庫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That leaves only four nations with secure nuclear arsenals.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.95,0:44:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,英國、中國、俄羅斯還有我們\N{\fnArial\fs30}U.K., China, Russia and us.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.83,0:44:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾經的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you were,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.53,0:44:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所做過的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything you’ve done.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.49,0:44:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是為了走到這一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}has come to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.85,0:46:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,中情局黑庫入侵案\N{\fnArial\fs30}The CIA Black Vault break-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.94,0:46:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 什麼是“NOC名單”？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m sorry, what is a "NOC list"?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.94,0:46:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們海外秘密特工的完整檔案記錄\N{\fnArial\fs30}A complete record of our covert operatives overseas.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.90,0:46:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,這麼說 這就是那個——\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is the man who…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.08,0:46:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵我們自己黑庫的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broke into our own Black Vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.95,0:46:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,順走了我們自家間諜的名單 沒錯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stole the list of our own spies, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.74,0:46:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他後來把名單歸還了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did return the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.22,0:46:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下一頁寫著呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s on the next page.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.00,0:46:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我沒看錯吧？克里姆林宮爆炸案？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I reading this correctly? The Kremlin bombing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.66,0:46:41.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,說句公道話 那枚炸彈原本就是為了除掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fairness, the bomb was actually meant to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.79,0:46:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在國家情報局的安保簡報會上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gassed a security briefing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.97,0:46:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,在國家情報局\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the National Intelligence Directorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.71,0:46:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西德尼] 那不過是兩個月前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Sidney] That was just two months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.59,0:46:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,當時你們二位應該都在那個會議現場\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two would have been in that meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.20,0:46:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是以基特里奇先生助手身份入場的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He arrived in the form of Mister Kittridge’s aide.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.86,0:47:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,並且據我所知 是以基特里奇先生的身份離開的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And left as Mister Kittridge, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.69,0:47:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,[瑟林] 這就能解釋手銬是怎麼回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Serling] This explains the handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.51,0:47:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他為什麼會在這兒 依然沒有說清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s still not clear why he’s here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.60,0:47:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你喜不喜歡 眼前這個男人是我們最後的退路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not, what we’re looking at is our means of last resort.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.17,0:47:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,極有可能是我們避免核末日危機的唯一希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite possibly our only hope of averting nuclear Armageddon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.78,0:47:19.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我們想控制智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we want to control the Entity,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.22,0:47:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就必須跟他打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to deal with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.01,0:47:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,倘若他願意接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should he choose to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.33,0:47:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,特工亨特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.24,0:47:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士 對於您的不幸遭遇 我深表遺憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President. I’m sorry for your loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.68,0:47:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,請坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.52,0:48:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,講講看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let’s hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.92,0:48:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要那把鑰匙以及一艘艦艇的使用權\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need that key and the use of a ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.92,0:48:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,具體來說 是一艘航空母艦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Specifically, an aircraft carrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.79,0:48:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,準確地講 是喬治·H·W·布什號\N{\fnArial\fs30}More specifically, the George H.W. Bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.32,0:48:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要“使用”\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants the "use of"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.63,0:48:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,價值六十五億美元的核動力軍事資產\N{\fnArial\fs30}a six-and-a-half billion dollar nuclear-powered military asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.50,0:48:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,還要指示艦長全力配合我的每一個要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}With instructions for the ship’s commander to accommodate my every request.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.07,0:48:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟要去做什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To do what exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.59,0:48:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,利用那把鑰匙以及它能開啟的東西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use that key and what it opens.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.55,0:48:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,去消滅智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kill the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.25,0:48:34.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,消滅智體就意味著網路世界的徹底毀滅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killing the Entity means the annihilation of cyberspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.38,0:48:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,其帶來的後果將是災難性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The consequences of which are catastrophic.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.91,0:48:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我憑什麼要按你說的做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell would I do what you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.43,0:48:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,恕我直言 總統女士 您別無選擇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Respectfully, Madam President, you have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.65,0:48:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,永遠都有別的選擇 不 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is always another choice. No, ma’am.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.13,0:48:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,在這種情況下 可沒有好選擇\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this case, not a good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.35,0:48:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球的核大國都陷入了人人自危的惡性迴圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world’s nuclear powers are in a paranoid downward spiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.05,0:48:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,每個國家本都有機會把他們的導彈下線\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every nation had a chance to take their missiles offline,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.23,0:48:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但誰也不信任別人會這麼做\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no one trusted anyone else to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.71,0:49:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,國務院正在向您發出警告 外交渠道正在癱瘓崩潰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your State Department is warning you that diplomatic channels are breaking down.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.28,0:49:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一個手頭還掌控著核武庫的人 都在考慮先發制人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone who still has control of their arsenals is considering a first strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.41,0:49:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟您現在想的一樣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.85,0:49:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,情報界心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}The intelligence community knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.29,0:49:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體在邊幹邊學\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the Entity is learning as it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.94,0:49:09.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,它變得越來越聰明 越來越強大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s getting smarter, it’s getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.16,0:49:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們很清楚我們只有72小時\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know that we have only 72 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.42,0:49:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,趕在地球上所有其他核武庫落入智體的控制之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before every other nuclear arsenal on Earth is under the Entity’s control.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.95,0:49:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天後 它會把全部能量集中於\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days before it focuses the full force of its energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.99,0:49:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,在這顆星球上最堅固、最安全的防禦系統上：我們的系統\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the toughest, most secure defense system on the planet: Ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.13,0:49:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那個時候 國防部將別無選擇 只能堅決主張\N{\fnArial\fs30}At which point, the Defense Department will have no choice but to insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.70,0:49:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,屆時你得去開啟那個箱子\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you open that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.39,0:49:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,輸入程式碼 向世上其餘八個核武庫\N{\fnArial\fs30}enter the codes, and launch an all-out preemptive strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.57,0:49:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,發起全面先發制人的打擊\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the world’s eight other nuclear arsenals.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.53,0:49:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,搶在智體接管我們的核武庫之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the Entity takes control of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.40,0:49:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.92,0:49:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,要麼由您來毀滅世界 要麼由智體來毀滅\N{\fnArial\fs30}either you destroy the world or the Entity does.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.27,0:49:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,無論哪種情況 都是死局\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, it is checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.97,0:49:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[埃裡卡] 還有另一個選擇\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Erika] There is another choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.54,0:49:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以告訴我關於那把鑰匙你知道的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could tell me what you know about that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.37,0:49:47.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,把控制智體的力量交給我們\N{\fnArial\fs30}and give us the power to control the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.72,0:49:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士 如果我相信那是真的 我會把我知道的全部告訴你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, if I believed that were true, I would tell you everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.37,0:49:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.33,0:49:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,您曾掌管中情局 您一眼就能看出什麼是心理戰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ran the CIA, you know psychological warfare when you see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.16,0:49:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看周圍吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.86,0:50:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們正身處智體塑造的現實中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in the Entity’s reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.52,0:50:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我相信 它正指望著由您來阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believe it’s counting on you to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.17,0:50:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你說的是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If what you’re saying is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.22,0:50:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎麼能確定智體不正是想讓我們去實施\N{\fnArial\fs30}how can you be sure the Entity doesn’t want us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.35,0:50:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你現在提議的方案呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}exactly what you’re proposing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.26,0:50:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 因為它知道您絕不會做這麼違背常理的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] Because it knows you would never do anything so illogical.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.87,0:50:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道信任我簡直是瘋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you would be insane to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.27,0:50:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而這也恰恰是您應該信任我的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is precisely why you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.01,0:50:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就這一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}For once,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.88,0:50:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,讓我們給智體個難題 讓它去操心我們下一步要幹什麼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let’s let the Entity worry about what we’re going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.01,0:50:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士 我是在擔心另外那三個國家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m worried about those three other nations, Madam President,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.93,0:50:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些仍然掌控著自己核武庫的國家\N{\fnArial\fs30}still in control of their arsenals.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.71,0:50:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些國家可能會陷入恐慌並發動全面攻擊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nations who could panic and launch a full-scale attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.46,0:50:32.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他卻在外面帶著一艘航空母艦 做著鬼才知道的事！\N{\fnArial\fs30}while he’s out there with an aircraft carrier, doing God knows what!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.29,0:50:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他卻在外面試圖去消滅智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}While he’s out there trying to kill the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.11,0:50:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們大家都很清楚這是個極其糟糕的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which we all know is a terrible idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.55,0:50:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士 求您了 我請求給我三天時間 在此期間由您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, please. I’m asking for three days while you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.86,0:50:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,來維持局勢平靜\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep the world calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.86,0:50:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.17,0:50:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾經……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I ever…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.91,0:50:47.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,讓您失望過嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}let you down before?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.52,0:50:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是智體決定在這之前就發起攻擊呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when the Entity decides to attack before then?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.69,0:50:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,它手頭的導彈已經足夠殺死數十億人了 它為什麼還沒動手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has enough missiles to kill billions already. Why hasn’t it done it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.35,0:50:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因為它是一臺機器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it’s a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.26,0:50:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在像機器一樣思考 不 它的思考模式……\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s thinking like a machine. No, its thinking…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.57,0:50:57.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,[國家安全局代表] 它的思考方式非0即1\N{\fnArial\fs30}[NSA representative] Its thinking is binary.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.09,0:50:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,……是由它從我們身上學到的東西決定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is dictated by what it’s learned from us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.10,0:51:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它之所以還沒發動攻擊 是因為它還沒有取得絕對控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hasn’t launched because it doesn’t have total control.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.58,0:51:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,它需要全世界的全部核武庫來確保達成理想的結果：\N{\fnArial\fs30}It needs the world’s entire atomic arsenal to guarantee the desired outcome:
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.23,0:51:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,人類的徹底毀滅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The total annihilation of humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.19,0:51:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.80,0:51:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定會等待的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is going to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.48,0:51:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[埃裡卡] 倫敦諾斯伍德核行動與目標定位中心已被攻破\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Erika] Northwood Nuclear Operations and Targeting Centre in London has been breached.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.14,0:51:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,英國已經失去了對其核武庫的控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}The United Kingdom has lost control of its arsenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.01,0:51:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最後再問你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will ask you one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.41,0:51:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,這能解鎖什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does this unlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.97,0:51:53.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃裡卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erika,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.19,0:51:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.15,0:51:57.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最後一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.24,0:51:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我跟你說的：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me when I tell you:
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.89,0:52:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,當倒計時在72小時後結束時\N{\fnArial\fs30}When that clock runs out in 72 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.77,0:52:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我會按下那個按鈕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will press that button,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.60,0:52:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那將是你的責任\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that will be your responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.86,0:52:10.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士——\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.60,0:52:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,警衛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeants,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.91,0:52:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他關起來！\N{\fnArial\fs30}lock him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.54,0:52:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,[士兵] 你聽到總統說的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[soldier] You heard the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.80,0:52:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有72小時\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have 72 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.51,0:52:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,她說等時機到了 你自然會知道怎麼用這玩意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says you’ll know what to do with this when the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.34,0:52:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,長官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.04,0:52:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好運\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.01,0:53:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等這一切結束後 我在上面給你留了條留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left you a message on there for when this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.37,0:53:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 你可以親口告訴我……\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] You can tell me yourself…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.37,0:53:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,之後\N{\fnArial\fs30}after.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.46,0:53:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,當他們給我們做出選擇時 他們讓我們立下了誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made us take an oath when they gave us the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.69,0:53:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們在陰影中生死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We live and die in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.12,0:53:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,為了我們珍視的人……\N{\fnArial\fs30}for those we hold close…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.43,0:53:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,也為了我們素未謀面的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for those we never meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.22,0:53:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什麼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what’s on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.87,0:53:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,當你留著那把鑰匙時 你就做出了正確的決定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the right thing when you kept the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.57,0:53:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,兄弟 你永遠都在正義的一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’ve always been on the right side, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.71,0:53:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,永遠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.10,0:53:59.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,切記\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.14,0:54:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們的生命不由單一行為來定義\N{\fnArial\fs30}our lives are not defined by any one action.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.54,0:54:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.80,0:54:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我們所有選擇的總和\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the sum of our choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.42,0:54:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我無怨無悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.46,0:54:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不該有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither should you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.12,0:55:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,[尼利] 埃裡卡——\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Neely] Did Erika…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.42,0:55:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統是否有對你說過\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.73,0:55:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,有沒有告訴你這紙條背後的寓意？\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell you the meaning behind this note?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.25,0:55:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒有 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, ma’am.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.95,0:55:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞爾維亞 1996年5月22日 我們倆都失去了至親至愛的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serbia. May 22nd, 1996. We both lost someone we loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.17,0:55:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,確實如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.96,0:55:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,全因掌權者無一人膽敢承擔風險\N{\fnArial\fs30}All because no one in authority would take a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.05,0:56:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我正坐在一桶火藥上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m sitting on a powder keg, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.53,0:56:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那個地平線之外 停著俄羅斯唯一的航母庫茲涅佐夫海軍元帥號\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just over that horizon is Russia’s only aircraft carrier, the Admiral Kuznetsov.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.19,0:56:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要一步走錯 就會引發二戰以來\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am one wrong move away from the first shoot-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.45,0:56:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,兩艘平頂船之間的首次交火\N{\fnArial\fs30}between two flattops since World War II.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.76,0:56:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍有不慎就會引爆第三次世界大戰\N{\fnArial\fs30}One flinch from touching off World War III.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.02,0:56:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你現在卻要我直接把你送進暴風眼去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you’re asking me to fly you directly into the eye of the storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.51,0:56:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 女士 正是如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma’am, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.73,0:56:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要找什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.60,0:56:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] SOSUS\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] SOSUS.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.08,0:56:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是“水下聲學監聽系統”的縮寫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short for "Sound Surveillance System."
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.47,0:56:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一套可以追溯到冷戰時期的全球水下聲學纜線網路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s a worldwide network of undersea acoustic cables.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.60,0:56:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,追溯到冷戰時期\N{\fnArial\fs30}dating back to the Cold War.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.69,0:56:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果世界上任何地方發生了任何有一定規模的水下事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}If an undersea event of any significance happens anywhere in the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.26,0:56:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,這些監聽站中的某一個就能將該事件精確定位到平方米以內\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of these listening stations will pinpoint that event to the square meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.40,0:56:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 而這些SOSUS監聽站中的某一個\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] And one of these SOSUS stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.05,0:56:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,定會記錄下我們失蹤的那艘俄羅斯潛艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}will have recorded our missing Russian submarine’s.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.05,0:56:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,在2012年冬天撞擊海底的聲音\N{\fnArial\fs30}impact on the sea floor in the winter of 2012.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.58,0:56:53.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卻根本不明白這一事件的重大意義\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without ever understanding the significance of the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.93,0:56:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 況且俄羅斯人清楚塞瓦斯托波爾號是什麼時候失聯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Whereas the Russians know when the Sevastopolvanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.45,0:56:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們只是不確定具體的地點\N{\fnArial\fs30}They’re just not exactly sure where.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.41,0:56:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 我們必須做出抉擇\N{\fnArial\fs30}[In French] We must make a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.72,0:57:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,究竟是哪一個\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.33,0:57:07.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在所有這些SOSUS監聽站中捕獲到了那一事件？\N{\fnArial\fs30}out of all these SOSUS stations picked up the event?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.29,0:57:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們知道塞瓦斯托波爾號船員的遺體是在海冰中被打撈出來的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know the bodies of the Sevastopol’screw were recovered in sea ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.29,0:57:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然是由因紐特漁民打撈上來的……\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since they were recovered by Inuit fishermen…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.08,0:57:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們推測它是在北極某處沉沒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’re guessing it went down somewhere in the Arctic.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.30,0:57:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜尋面積大約為五百五十萬平方英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A search area of roughly five and a half million square miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.82,0:57:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,意味著最有可能記錄下它的SOSUS監聽站是……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning the most likely SOSUS station to pick it up is…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.30,0:57:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,這一個 在白令海\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one. In the Bering Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.09,0:57:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 聖馬修島\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] St. Matthew Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.61,0:57:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄羅斯人也會知道這一點\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russians will know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.75,0:57:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們為什麼不乾脆強攻該島呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why haven’t they just stormed the island already?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.66,0:57:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因為聖馬修島是美國政府的設施\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because St. Matthew is a U.S. Government installation.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.14,0:57:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,明目張膽的侵略行為會引發第三次世界大戰\N{\fnArial\fs30}An overt act of aggression would trigger World War III.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.36,0:57:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但現在末日要來了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now Armageddon is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.84,0:57:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 俄方現在已經豁出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] And the Russians have nothing to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.28,0:57:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的夥伴們清楚他們正深陷重圍嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do your friends know they’re walking into a potential siege?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.02,0:57:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們知道這是職責所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know that’s the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.16,0:57:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 為了從塞瓦斯托波爾號上找回智體的原始碼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, to retrieve the Entity’s source code from Sevastopol,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.38,0:57:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森需要聖馬修島上的精確座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan needs the precise coordinates from St. Matthew Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.42,0:57:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,顯然還得有一艘潛艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a submarine, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.69,0:57:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,一艘願意把你送去任何地方的潛艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that’s willing to take you where you want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.25,0:58:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,絕不多問\N{\fnArial\fs30}No questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.78,0:58:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma’am.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.17,0:58:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,前提是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that’s assuming.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.65,0:58:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的同伴真能拿到座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}your friends can actually get the coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.83,0:58:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,預計我們得每隔兩小時發送十五分鐘……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which we’re expected to transmit for fifteen minutes every two hours…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.48,0:58:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,指望伊森能設法收到我們的訊號\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the hope that Ethan is somehow able to receive our signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.10,0:58:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打算怎麼從冰蓋下面浮上來？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you intend to make it out from under the ice cap?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.92,0:58:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,將座標發給我之後 我的隊員會前往該處\N{\fnArial\fs30}After sending me the coordinates, my team will make their way there.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.71,0:58:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 接著 伊森會攜帶一臺甚高頻發射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Now, Ethan will have a VHF transmitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.89,0:58:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,這樣我們在冰層下方就能鎖定他的精確方位\N{\fnArial\fs30}which will enable us to zero in on his exact location under the ice.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.24,0:58:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,到時候我們只要拿上一把電鋸然後——\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we have to do then is grab a chainsaw and…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.94,0:58:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麼？在冰蓋上鋸個洞直接把伊森拽出來？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Cut a hole in the ice cap and just pull Ethan out?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.68,0:58:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 這得看那艘沉船有多深\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. Depending on how deep that wreck is,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.29,0:58:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森浮出水面前就會患上嚴重的減壓病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan will have severe decompression sickness before he reaches the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.77,0:58:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,這也就是我們帶上這玩意的緣故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why we have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.60,0:58:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲] 那究竟是個什麼東西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace] What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.69,0:58:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是一套最先進的可充氣式高壓減壓艙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a state-of-the-art inflatable hyperbaric decompression chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.65,0:58:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在開玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’re not serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.87,0:58:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麼？你是說伊森的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? You mean to tell me that Ethan’s life.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.92,0:59:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及地球上所有生命的命運\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the fate of all life on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.18,0:59:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,全看我們所有人能否在分毫不差的同一地點碰頭\N{\fnArial\fs30}depends on us all meeting at the exact same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.58,0:59:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,且在完全相同的時刻碰頭\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the exact same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.06,0:59:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在白令海冰封的某個角落……\N{\fnArial\fs30}somewhere in the frozen Bering Sea…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.24,0:59:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,方能成事\N{\fnArial\fs30}with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.33,0:59:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 沒錯\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.76,0:59:15.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果我們在趕到之前他就淹死了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what if he drowns before we get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.98,0:59:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,大機率會的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all likelihood, he will.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.25,0:59:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在那麼冷的水裡 低體溫症會減緩他的新陳代謝\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in water that cold, the hypothermia will slow down his metabolic functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.55,0:59:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,併為我們爭取時間復甦他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and buy us time to revive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.08,0:59:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,這就是你的計劃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.95,0:59:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒錯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.04,0:59:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,這就是我們的計劃\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s our plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.05,0:59:39.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,射程內唯一的潛艇是“俄亥俄號”\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only submarine in range is the Ohio.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.48,0:59:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,傑克·布萊德索的艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack Bledsoe’s boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.36,0:59:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在水下潛航時\N{\fnArial\fs30}When submerged,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.66,0:59:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能透過超低頻電臺聯絡他——遮蔽任何數字傳輸\N{\fnArial\fs30}he’s reachable only by VLF radio… shielded from any digital transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.06,0:59:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,這意味著他對這東西免疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means he is immune to this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.23,0:59:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但前提是他必須保持潛航\N{\fnArial\fs30}But only if he stays submerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.67,0:59:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,“魚鷹”能在兩小時內把你送過去 但燃料不夠等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Osprey can get you there in two hours, but it won’t have enough fuel to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.80,0:59:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,別無選擇\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.50,1:00:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果布萊德索收到我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Bledsoe receives my command,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.72,1:00:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他相信這是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he believes it to be authentic,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.38,1:00:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能會上浮到潛望鏡深度\N{\fnArial\fs30}he might come to periscope depth.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.12,1:00:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可能會等三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He might wait thirty seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.60,1:00:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你們哪怕遲到了一分鐘……\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you are even one minute late…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.04,1:00:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,給我這個機會就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me this chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.68,1:00:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,[國家偵察局代表] 你放走亨特了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[NRO representative] You let Hunt go?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.82,1:00:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是這麼說的 帶著鑰匙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s what I said. With the key?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.86,1:00:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒有那東西他做不了什麼 那他現在在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn’t do much without it. So where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.56,1:00:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜在北太平洋的某個地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere in the Northern Pacific, I assume.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.87,1:01:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你給了他一艘航空母艦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave him an aircraft carrier?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.66,1:01:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,部長先生 我是武裝部隊總司令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the Commander in Chief of the Armed Forces, Mister Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.31,1:01:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的航空母艦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my aircraft carrier.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.66,1:01:11.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想怎麼用就怎麼用\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I do with it as I please.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.18,1:01:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早就知道會這樣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew this would happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.27,1:01:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有懷疑過\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.54,1:01:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你至少可以告訴我們一聲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have at least told us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.02,1:01:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我剛說了 現在你們可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just did. And now you’re excused.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.37,1:01:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士——就這樣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President… That will be all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.99,1:01:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告訴你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn’t tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.47,1:01:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,這必須是我的責任 而且只能由我承擔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had to be my responsibility and mine alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.17,1:01:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我得為亨特爭取時間\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I had to buy Hunt time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.48,1:01:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人可能會試圖阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone could have tried to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.61,1:01:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們或許不同意你的做法 但他們確實尊重你的權威\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may not agree with you, but they do respect your authority.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.18,1:01:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在這一切結束之前 會有人恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before this is over, someone will panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.79,1:01:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,會有人試圖阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone will try to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.02,1:02:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是一場外勤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another field trip.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.20,1:02:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他在哪？我知道他最終會去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where he’s at? I know where he’s gonna end up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.55,1:02:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,給他個驚喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let’s surprise him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.27,1:02:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 記住 各國為了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Now remember, governments would kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.14,1:02:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道我們對“塞瓦斯托波爾”號的瞭解 會不惜殺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to know what we know about the Sevastopol.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.27,1:02:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是個中情局監聽站\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a CIA station.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.53,1:02:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,由經驗豐富的外勤特工運營 他們受過訓練以獲取情報 且絕不、絕不吐露\N{\fnArial\fs30}run by seasoned field agents trained to get information and never, ever give it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.19,1:02:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,千萬別向他們透露我們的真正任務 讓我來跟他們交涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them nothing about our real mission. Just let me do the talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.96,1:03:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.66,1:03:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要幫忙嗎？我正有此意 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you? I certainly hope so. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.18,1:03:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們在找SOSUS監聽站\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’re looking for the SOSUS listening station.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.84,1:03:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們找到了 朋友 我是站長 比爾·東洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found it, friend. I’m the station chief, Bill Donloe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.10,1:03:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻子 塔皮莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife, Tapeesa.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.93,1:03:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 你好 近來可好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Hello. How do you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.45,1:03:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高興認識你 比爾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, nice to meet you, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.50,1:03:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們是英國地震研究所的研究人員——\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’re researchers from the British Seismological…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.93,1:03:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你剛才說東洛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m sorry, did you say Donloe?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.81,1:03:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒錯 [班吉] 比爾\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s right. [Benji] Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.20,1:03:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·東洛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Donloe?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.20,1:03:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,蘭利的東洛？黑庫的東洛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Langley Donloe? Black Vault Donloe?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.77,1:03:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,[東洛] 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.25,1:03:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.60,1:03:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢相信……你們是認真…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don’t believe… Are you ser…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.21,1:03:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,這傢伙可是寫程式的傳奇人物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy is a coding legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.82,1:03:51.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,他設計了蘭利的中情局大型機 黑庫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He designed the CIA mainframe at Langley. The Black Vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.56,1:03:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是地球上最安全的資料庫 完全無法攻破\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s the most secure database on the planet. It’s completely impenetrable.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.48,1:03:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 如果真無法攻破 我就不會在這了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it were impenetrable, I wouldn’t be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.79,1:04:00.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那個資料庫在96年被攻破了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Vault was breached in ’96.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.31,1:04:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,局裡當天就把我發配到了這兒\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the agency shipped me out the same day.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.53,1:04:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,從那以後就一直在這\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been here ever since.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.36,1:04:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 也就是說你在這個島上待了……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. So you mean to say you’ve been on this island for…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.80,1:04:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,三十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty years.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.06,1:04:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,出於好奇 你怎麼知道黑庫的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just out of curiosity, how do you know about the Black Vault?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.89,1:04:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是絕密\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s highly classified.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.85,1:04:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,滴答滴答 滴答滴答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tick-tock, tick-tock, tick-tock.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.42,1:04:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 請問兩位究竟是何方神聖？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Who did you say you were?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.68,1:04:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接告訴這人我們為什麼來吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just tell the man why we’re here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.64,1:04:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,東洛先生 比爾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Donloe. Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.95,1:04:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我們能告訴你真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we could tell you the truth,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.51,1:04:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不會相信的 我不會信\N{\fnArial\fs30}you wouldn’t believe it. I wouldn’t.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.21,1:04:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,關鍵在於我們需要訪問\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart of the matter is that we need access.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.95,1:04:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,存取你們自2012年冬末以來的每一筆SOSUS資料\N{\fnArial\fs30}to all your SOSUS data from late winter 2012.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.74,1:04:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,否則幾天後世界就不復存在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise the world will cease to exist in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.35,1:04:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在發生 對吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s happening, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.48,1:04:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,實體\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Entity.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.40,1:04:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我多年來一直試圖警告人們 但是……\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’ve tried to warn people about it for years, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.23,1:04:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒人聽\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one would listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.75,1:04:53.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能幫我們嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help us?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.93,1:04:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.24,1:05:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盤子碰撞聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[dishes clattering]
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.77,1:05:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[俄羅斯士兵] 請進\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Russian soldier] Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.39,1:05:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,請隨便坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make yourself comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.09,1:05:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[飛行員1] 長官！醒醒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[airman 1] Sir! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.13,1:05:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 長官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wake up, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.92,1:05:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們有麻煩了 大麻煩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got problems. Real problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.75,1:05:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎麼回事？是“庫茲涅佐夫”號\N{\fnArial\fs30}What’s happening? It’s the Admiral Kuznetsov.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.40,1:05:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,[飛行員1] 我們得離開這兒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[airman 1] We got to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.32,1:05:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們進入老伊萬的威脅區了 夥計\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’re in Ivan’s threat zone, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.71,1:05:41.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到“俄亥俄號”的蹤跡了嗎？沒有 長官 而且我們到返航油量點了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of the Ohio? No, sir. And we’re at bingo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.54,1:05:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再不調頭 燃料就不夠飛回母艦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don’t turn around soon, we won’t have enough fuel to get us back to the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.37,1:05:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,電臺有什麼訊息？VHF全都是雜音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything on the radio? Nothing but static on VHF.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.85,1:05:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的朋友們在發訊號 我們根本聽不見\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your friends are broadcasting a signal, we can’t hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.29,1:05:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,直接懸停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take us into a hover.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.55,1:05:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,長官 我們到返航油量點了 只有五分鐘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we are at bingo. Five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.51,1:05:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,給五分鐘就行 拜託！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me five minutes. Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.04,1:05:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們可以通融一分鐘\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can give you one.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.69,1:06:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,減速\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decel.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.22,1:06:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們懸停幹什麼？得趕緊撤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing in a hover? We got to bug out!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.61,1:06:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,發現兩個敵機目標\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bogies at two.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.23,1:06:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們亮出導彈了 夥計\N{\fnArial\fs30}They’re showing us their missiles, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.36,1:06:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,這可是他們唯一的警告了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s the only warning we’re gonna get.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.41,1:06:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄羅斯飛機……這簡直是第三次世界大戰的節奏 我們得走了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russian Aircraft… This is some World War III shit here. We got to go!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.71,1:06:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,[飛行員2] 國際領空 沒有挑釁意圖\N{\fnArial\fs30}[airman 2] International airspace. No challenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.45,1:06:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我重複：絕無挑釁意圖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repeat: No challenge is intended.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.81,1:06:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底要去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.39,1:06:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,[顫抖]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[shuddering]
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.40,1:07:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,[戰慄]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[shudders]
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.35,1:07:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪 伊森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, Ethan?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.89,1:07:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,[瑟瑟發抖]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[shivers]
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.39,1:08:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定就是布萊德索艦長吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be Captain Bledsoe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.57,1:08:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你一定瘋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you must be out of your mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.22,1:08:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我們沒出現 你們原本的計劃到底是什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly was the plan if we hadn’t shown up?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.23,1:08:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,說實話 我還沒想那麼遠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I really hadn’t thought that far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.23,1:08:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.75,1:08:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.98,1:08:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 妮莉少將向你問好\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] Rear Admiral Neely sends her regards.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.42,1:08:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她跟我說會看到一顆綠色訊號彈\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me to expect a green flare.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.33,1:08:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可沒提過泰瑟槍\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never mentioned a Taser.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.94,1:08:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,能解釋一下這到底是怎麼回事嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind telling me what this is all about?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.16,1:08:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的任務是機密的 哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mission is classified. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.43,1:08:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帶我往北走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to take me north.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.17,1:08:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,繼續\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continue.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.78,1:08:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等一組精確的座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m expecting a set of exact coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.34,1:08:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,透過摩斯電碼傳輸\N{\fnArial\fs30}via Morse code transmission.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.22,1:09:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你究竟指望怎麼在水底下收到這訊號呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just how exactly do you expect to receive them down here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.52,1:09:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必須上浮到潛望鏡深度\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’d have to come to periscope depth.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.40,1:09:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,升起天線\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raise the antenna.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.14,1:09:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,掃描VHF頻段的低端訊號\N{\fnArial\fs30}Signal-scan the low end of the VHF band.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.36,1:09:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久？十五分鐘\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long? Fifteen minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.23,1:09:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那會給俄羅斯人十五分鐘來精確定位我們的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would give the Russians fifteen minutes to pinpoint our location.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.32,1:09:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,從正午開始 之後每兩小時一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting at noon, and every two hours after that,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.32,1:09:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我的團隊把座標發給我\N{\fnArial\fs30}until my team sends me those coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.72,1:09:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,[布萊德索] 北邊是白令海 閣下\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Bledsoe] North is the Bering Sea, mister.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.72,1:09:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在俄羅斯太平洋艦隊的潛艇全都在那上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now every submarine in the Russian Pacific Fleet is up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.29,1:09:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的首要任務是鎖定它們的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}My primary mission is to lock down their positions.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.73,1:09:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,並弄清楚它們在搞什麼鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ascertain what they’re up to.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.65,1:09:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你知道答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m thinking you know the answer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.00,1:09:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 那是什麼？那是聖馬修島\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] What is that? That’s St. Matthew Island.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.35,1:09:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那裡除了一箇舊SOSUS監聽站什麼都沒有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s nothing there but an old SOSUS listening station.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.83,1:09:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 旁邊那個 那是什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, that right next to it. What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.40,1:09:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,[布萊德索] 那是“洛沙裡克”\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Bledsoe] That’s the Losharik.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.01,1:09:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那是什麼嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what that is?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.06,1:09:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一艘微型潛艇 俄羅斯特種部隊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s a mini-sub, Russian Special Forces.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.54,1:10:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,給你頒個乖寶寶貼紙好了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get yourself a gold star, mister.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.58,1:10:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,剛才一個多小時前 空中偵察在聖馬修島附近發現了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aerial recon spotted it off St. Matthew Island just over an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.59,1:10:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是從這個上面放出來的：\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s deployed from this:
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.94,1:10:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「別爾哥羅德」號 俄國海軍陣中最致命的核潛艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Belgorod.The deadliest submarine in the Russian Navy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.55,1:10:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的第二任務是找到那個雜種並將其處於受控威脅之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My secondary mission is to locate that bastard and hold it at risk.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.68,1:10:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然有“洛沙裡克” 說明它就在附近不遠\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Losharikmeans it’s somewhere close by.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.73,1:10:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那個島上有你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have people on that island.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.43,1:10:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的座標就是從那發出的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s where your coordinates are coming from.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.91,1:10:29.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你會幫我嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.83,1:10:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,閣下……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.40,1:10:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想去捋北極熊的鬍子\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to poke the bear,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.71,1:10:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼 你可找對人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, you’ve come to the right man.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.28,1:10:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你的潛水長談談 長官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like to speak with your divemaster, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.71,1:10:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,長官！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.93,1:10:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 長官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.54,1:10:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫皮爾斯去海軍陸戰隊偵察營房迎接我們的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have Pills meet our guest in the FORECON quarters.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.02,1:10:50.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[長官] 是 長官 這邊請 長官\N{\fnArial\fs30}[chief] Aye, sir. This way, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.24,1:10:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,[東洛] 正如我向這裡的各位解釋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Donloe] As I’ve explained to our friends here,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.07,1:10:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我沒有他們要的資料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don’t have the data they want.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.20,1:11:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,局裡對我的系統升級申請晾了十年\N{\fnArial\fs30}The agency ignored my request to upgrade our system for a decade.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.30,1:11:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,結果有一天突然來了一隊人 毫無預兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day a team shows up, unannounced,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.95,1:11:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,幾天之內就改裝了整個系統\N{\fnArial\fs30}and refits the entire system in a matter of days.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.74,1:11:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那是2012年冬天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m guessing this is the winter of 2012.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.61,1:11:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒錯 老系統靠磁帶執行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. The old system ran on magnetic tapes,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.22,1:11:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,備份在8英寸軟盤裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}backed up to 8-inch floppies.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.09,1:11:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,這些都在後面的狗舍裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}These were in the dog shed out back.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.61,1:11:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,這些箱子裡可能裝著你們\N{\fnArial\fs30}These boxes might contain the coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.40,1:11:18.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都在找的座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}you’re all looking for,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.14,1:11:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我沒有讀取裝置\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don’t have a reader.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.58,1:11:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也在2012年被收走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was also taken away in 2012.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.28,1:11:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你指望他自己做一個\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expect him to build one.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.45,1:11:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是來找座標的 不是來找箱子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came for coordinates, not boxes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.63,1:11:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,假設你找到了座標 我的人怎麼辦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposing you find the coordinates. What happens to my team?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.07,1:11:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我會把座標帶給上級 我的人留在這\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will take the coordinates to my superiors. My men wait here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.63,1:11:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我們找到了我們要找的東西\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we have located what we’re looking for,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.51,1:11:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人就會離開 而你不會受到傷害\N{\fnArial\fs30}my men will leave and you will not be harmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.55,1:11:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果換作是你 你會信嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you believe that if you were me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.73,1:11:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不會\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I would not.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.99,1:11:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,給你一個小時把驅動器造出來\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one hour to build the drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.47,1:11:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什麼名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What’s your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.74,1:11:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,科爾佐夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koltsov.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.82,1:11:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字？艦長\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your first name? Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.65,1:11:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,科爾佐夫 我是格蕾絲 那是班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Koltsov, I’m Grace. That’s Benji.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.57,1:11:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們能不能花五分鐘 像真正的人類一樣談談？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we just, for five minutes, be human beings?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.05,1:12:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是俄羅斯人 也不是美國人 只是想再次見到摯愛的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Russians, not Americans, just people that want to see our loved ones again.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.71,1:12:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我孤身一人 連條狗都沒有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no one. Not even a dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.06,1:12:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,哼 你肯定沒有這把鑰匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you certainly don’t have this key.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.32,1:12:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把十字形鑰匙 能讓持有者進入“波德科瓦”\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cruciform key that grants the holder access to the Podkova.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.98,1:12:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你們有了座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you have the coordinates,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.89,1:12:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒有我們的幫助\N{\fnArial\fs30}you still can’t safely retrieve the Entity’s source code.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.07,1:12:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們也無法安全地找回智體的原始碼\N{\fnArial\fs30}without our help.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.90,1:12:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們還有另一把鑰匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have another key,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.68,1:12:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,對吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}don’t you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.47,1:12:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們一直都有一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’ve had one all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.08,1:12:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們缺的只是座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you don’t have are the coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.73,1:12:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,而等你們造好驅動器\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when you build the drive,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.35,1:12:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們就有了座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}we will have that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.48,1:12:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 換個方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let’s try something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.35,1:12:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我告訴你 我們有個朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I told you that we have a friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.79,1:12:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,因為拒絕交出這把鑰匙而被自己的政府開除了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who’s been disavowed by his own government because he refused to hand over this key?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.27,1:12:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們的朋友現在就在外面 不受任何指揮鏈約束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our friend is out there right now, independent from any chain of command,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.62,1:12:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,正等著我們傳輸那些座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}waiting for us to transmit those coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.36,1:12:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必會排除萬難\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he will stop at nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.36,1:12:56.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,確保安然取得「波德科瓦」並利用其上存放的原始碼\N{\fnArial\fs30}to safely retrieve the Podkova and use the source code stored on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.93,1:12:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,徹底摧毀智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}to destroy the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.54,1:13:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,這不僅僅為了某一個國家 而是為了全人類\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not for the sake of any one nation, but for all.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.59,1:13:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你還不明白嗎？智體正指望我們彼此猜忌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don’t you see? The Entity is counting on us to distrust each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.46,1:13:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.85,1:13:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,讓我們完成使命吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}let us complete our mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.12,1:13:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們並非敵人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not enemies.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.77,1:13:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,換作是你 你會相信嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you believe that if you were me?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.43,1:13:18.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,[輕聲] 不會\N{\fnArial\fs30}[softly] No.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.96,1:13:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我也不會\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose I wouldn’t.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.87,1:13:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們只有一個小時\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have one hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.44,1:13:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是第七代抗壓服\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Mark VII pressure suit,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.18,1:13:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,專為縮短深海潛水後的\N{\fnArial\fs30}specifically designed to reduce decompression time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.62,1:13:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,減壓時間而設計\N{\fnArial\fs30}after diving profound depths.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.67,1:13:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是透過氧氣與惰性氣體的特殊混合物來實現這一點的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does this by means of an exotic mixture of oxygen and inert gases.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.80,1:13:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要進行長時間的呼吸適應 身體才能承受\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’ll need to do an extended breathe-up for your body to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.54,1:13:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們具體在說哪種氣體？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly what kind of gases are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.81,1:13:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是機密\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s classified.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.68,1:13:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,[皮爾斯] 假設你執行任務的時間在二十分鐘以內\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Pills] Assuming you’re on task for twenty minutes or less,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.20,1:13:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的減壓時間就會從幾天縮短到幾小時\N{\fnArial\fs30}your time in decompression will be cut down from days to hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.95,1:13:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,理論上是這樣 理論上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Theoretically. Theoretically?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.08,1:14:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們還沒在300英尺以下測試過第七代潛水服\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven’t tested the Mark VII below 300 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.87,1:14:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,[潛水員1] 為了節省空氣 你需要快速下潛\N{\fnArial\fs30}[diver 1] To conserve air, you’ll need to make a fast descent.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.78,1:14:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,這意味著必然會出現高壓神經綜合徵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means guaranteed HPNS.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.74,1:14:09.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,高壓神經綜合徵\N{\fnArial\fs30}High Pressure Nervous Syndrome.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.57,1:14:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你應當預料到會有戰慄、\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should expect tremors,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.40,1:14:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽搐、眩暈、\N{\fnArial\fs30}shakes, dizziness,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.18,1:14:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,迷失方向以及精神錯亂\N{\fnArial\fs30}disorientation, and mental confusion.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.75,1:14:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且這一切都發生在極端壓力之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all of it under extreme pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.71,1:14:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,[皮爾斯] 就算第七代潛水服按預期運轉\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Pills] Even if the Mark VII works as designed,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.98,1:14:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們的混合氣體也不夠支撐緩慢上浮\N{\fnArial\fs30}you still won’t have enough mixture for a slow ascent.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.15,1:14:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,這意味著你鐵定會得減壓病\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you’re guaranteed to get the bends.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.29,1:14:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,[皮爾斯] 你肌肉組織里的氮氣會膨脹進入血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Pills] Nitrogen in your muscle tissue expands into your bloodstream.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.42,1:14:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,[潛水員2] 劇痛難忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}[diver 2] Excruciating pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.77,1:14:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,全身抽搐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Convulsions.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.56,1:14:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,肌肉徹底失控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Complete loss of muscle control.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.26,1:14:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你大概只有二十分鐘的時間趕到減壓艙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’ll have maybe twenty minutes to get to the decompression chamber.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.48,1:14:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而如果沒有減壓艙……\N{\fnArial\fs30}And without the decompression chamber…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.79,1:14:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,[皮爾斯] 你就死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Pills] You’re a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.45,1:15:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[布萊德索] 又一輪甚高頻掃描結束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Bledsoe] Another VHF scan came and went.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.40,1:15:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的朋友們在廣播\N{\fnArial\fs30}If your friends are broadcasting,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.62,1:15:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們依然沒收到訊號\N{\fnArial\fs30}we still haven’t picked it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.25,1:15:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快點 快點 快點 快點 快點\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.39,1:15:33.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是馬廄裡的雪橇犬 準備開飯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s the sled dogs out in the barn. It’s coming up to dinnertime.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.45,1:15:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我來告訴你一個小秘密 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m gonna let you in on a little secret, friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.41,1:15:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,這些磁碟裡根本沒有座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are no coordinates on any of these disks.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.93,1:15:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,十四年前那次“翻新”？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That "refit" fourteen years ago?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.76,1:15:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎麼看都透著一股掩蓋真相的惡臭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It had all the stench of a cover-up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.46,1:16:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那個負責人對塔皮莎居高臨下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the top man talked down to Tapeesa.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.38,1:16:06.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很討厭那樣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.77,1:16:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我從來沒跟他們提過這些備份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told them about these backups.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.47,1:16:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他們走後 我自己把每一份備份都翻了個遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when they left, I went through every one of them myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.52,1:16:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯獨有一件事非常扎眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lone event stood out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.26,1:16:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一場大規模的海底內爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}A massive undersea implosion.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.61,1:16:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就發生在他們來收走所有東西的大約一個月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}about a month before they arrived to take everything away.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.14,1:16:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,照理說 我當時根本不懂這有什麼重大意義\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally, I didn’t understand the significance.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.58,1:16:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是我記下了那組座標 然後\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I noted the coordinates and then.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.71,1:16:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,親手銷燬了僅存的這張磁碟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I destroyed the only disk.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.02,1:16:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,[低聲] 你的意思是你知道“塞瓦斯托波爾”號的沉船點？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[quietly] Are you saying you know where the Sevastopolis?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.89,1:16:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,精確到一平方米以內\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down to the square meter.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.17,1:16:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,開飯啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dinnertime.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.48,1:16:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,能讓我太太去照看一下那些狗嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can my wife please tend to the dogs?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.96,1:17:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,這麼大噪聲我實在無法集中精力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can’t concentrate with this racket.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.06,1:17:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,[因紐特語] 座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in Inuktitut] The coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.80,1:17:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,務必當心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.37,1:17:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愛你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.85,1:17:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們還會再相見的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.47,1:17:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一個人忙不過來 我去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}She’s gonna need some help.I’ll go!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.65,1:17:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好出去透透氣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could use the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.39,1:17:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,[俄語] 跟他們一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in Russian] Go with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.63,1:18:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,[布萊德索] 距離下一輪無線電廣播視窗還有五分鐘\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Bledsoe] Five minutes to the next broadcast window.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:08.20,1:18:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們馬上就要潛入冰蓋下方並徹底失聯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’ll be under the ice cap soon and lose all comms.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.55,1:18:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,這將是我們最後的機會\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be our last chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.41,1:18:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,[雜音鏗鏘]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[clattering]
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.27,1:19:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,值班軍官 升起一號通訊天線\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief of the Watch, raise number one comms antenna.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.72,1:19:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麼？等等！等等 哈加爾\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Wait! Wait, Hagar.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.81,1:19:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.46,1:19:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 這是什麼？這是什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. What is this? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.25,1:19:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你阻止不了智體 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won’t stop the Entity, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.95,1:19:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能讓你這麼做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can’t let you.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.38,1:20:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,東洛 去電臺！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donloe, get to the radio!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.30,1:20:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,傳送座標！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send the coordinates!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.79,1:20:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,[嘶嘶聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[hisses]
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.68,1:21:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,[無線電軍官] 指揮艙無線電！收到VHF莫斯電碼\N{\fnArial\fs30}[radio officer] Conn radio! VHF Morse code incoming.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.99,1:21:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,無線電 外放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radio, on speaker.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.49,1:21:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈加爾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hagar,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.71,1:21:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你花在……\N{\fnArial\fs30}you’ve spent too much…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.67,1:21:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,上的時間\N{\fnArial\fs30}time.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.02,1:21:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the Internet!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.78,1:21:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[哈加爾吃力喘息]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Hagar straining]
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.32,1:22:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[掙扎]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[struggling]
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.12,1:22:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[俄語] 他在傳送座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in Russian] He’s sending the coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.77,1:22:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們的人在聽著\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our people are listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.99,1:22:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋頂要塌了 快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The roof is collapsing. Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.47,1:23:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.13,1:23:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,東洛呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where’s Donloe?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.21,1:23:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,東洛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donloe!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.30,1:23:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們得走了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.13,1:24:13.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,[布萊德索] 你想要的座標\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Bledsoe] The coordinates you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.74,1:24:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你上錯船了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m afraid you’re on the wrong boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.39,1:24:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那裡距離好望角有2000英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s 2, 000 miles off the Cape of Good Hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.61,1:24:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地球的另一端\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the other side of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.70,1:24:23.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,幾乎分毫不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn near exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.97,1:24:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,“分毫不差 ”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Exactly."
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.46,1:24:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.51,1:24:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,以防俄羅斯人在竊聽\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case the Russians were listening.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.12,1:24:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常高明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very clever.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.56,1:24:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,值班軍官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer of the Deck,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.73,1:24:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,設定新航向：3-4-0\N{\fnArial\fs30}set a new course: 3-4-0.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.82,1:24:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,[軍官] 舵向右15度 保持航向3-4-0穩舵\N{\fnArial\fs30}[officer] Right 15 degrees rudder, steady on course 3-4-0.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.73,1:24:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,[舵手] 是 長官 舵向右15度\N{\fnArial\fs30}[helmsman] Aye, sir. My rudder is right 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.48,1:24:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,值班軍官 水下接觸 方位1-0-0\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer of the Deck, submerged contact, bearing 1-0-0.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.13,1:24:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我們右舷消音瓦邊緣\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the edge of our starboard baffles.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.13,1:25:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,外放 呈現俄羅斯奧斯卡II級潛艇的音響特徵\N{\fnArial\fs30}On speaker. Exhibiting tonals of a Russian Oscar II-class submarine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.79,1:25:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,值班長官 悄悄建立火控跟蹤組\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief of the Watch, station the fire control tracking party silently.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.70,1:25:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[長官] 悄悄地 是 長官 好吧 算是完成了一個任務\N{\fnArial\fs30}[chief] Silently. Aye, sir. Well, that’s one mission accomplished.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.40,1:25:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們找到了“別爾哥羅德”號\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found the Belgorod.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.06,1:25:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正緊緊尾隨在後\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s right on our ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.32,1:25:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,無論你的任務要把你帶到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever your mission is taking you,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.15,1:25:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在你把俄羅斯人也帶到那去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}now you’re taking the Russians there.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.46,1:25:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他們永遠不會知道我的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they’re never gonna know my destination.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.76,1:25:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,當我們到達那些座標時 我要你減速到十節\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we reach those coordinates, I’d like you to slow to ten knots,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.16,1:25:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把這艘船掉頭\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn this boat around.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.85,1:25:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,帶著俄羅斯人按原路返回\N{\fnArial\fs30}and take the Russians back the way we came.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.94,1:25:29.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的任務怎麼辦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens to your mission then?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.47,1:25:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我會在掉頭的地方下艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’ll be getting off at the turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.21,1:25:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,長官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mister,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.00,1:25:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果沒有我們的減壓艙 你必死無疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}without our decompression chamber, you’ll die for sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.52,1:25:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,長官 你的減壓艙從來不在我們的計劃之內\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, your decompression chamber was never part of our plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.62,1:25:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.40,1:25:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.58,1:25:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的計劃究竟是什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly is your plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.56,1:26:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.23,1:26:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲] 哈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.14,1:26:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？不！不 不 我不會 我不知道怎麼弄 我不知道怎麼弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me? No! No, no, I can’t. I don’t know how. I don’t know how.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.85,1:26:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,當然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.11,1:26:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,當然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.33,1:26:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,行 做給我看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Show me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.42,1:26:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是“左”\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s "left."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.99,1:27:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲重複]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace repeats]
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.39,1:27:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲重複]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace repeats]
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.91,1:27:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,“向前”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Forward."
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.92,1:27:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.62,1:27:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲] 這個？“噢”是停嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace] On this? "Wooh" is stop?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.53,1:27:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wooh.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.27,1:27:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲] 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace] Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:23.58,1:27:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是幹什麼用的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What’s this for?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.55,1:27:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,北極熊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polar bear?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.64,1:27:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,[說因紐特語 模仿槍聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[speaks Inuktitut, imitates gunshot]
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.94,1:28:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,這就是你的鑰匙 好嗎？接通電源\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s your key, okay? Power on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.46,1:28:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,深呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.59,1:28:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,[呼吸器嘶嘶作響]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[respirator hisses]
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.64,1:28:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,第七代潛水服的導航系統會帶你到達座標位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Mark VII’s guidance system will take you to your coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.38,1:28:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所在位置的深度是500英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}The depth at your location is 500 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.86,1:28:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,預計到達目標19分鐘 作業10分鐘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Figure 19 minutes to your target, 10 minutes on task.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.26,1:28:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,記住：\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember:
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.52,1:28:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,超過這個時間\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any longer than that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.13,1:28:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的生還機率每秒都在下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your chances of survival decrease by the second.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.18,1:28:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,別忘了：\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don’t forget:
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.92,1:28:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,上浮時必須持續呼氣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must exhale continuously as you rise to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.79,1:28:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果屏住呼吸 你的肺會炸裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your breath and your lungs will explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.84,1:28:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的VHF發射器\N{\fnArial\fs30}The VHF transmitter you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.27,1:28:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的團隊應該能夠在兩英里半徑內定位你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your team should be able to locate you within a two-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.80,1:28:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,給我照顧好它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look after that.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.11,1:28:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好運\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.60,1:29:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顧好我的潛水服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of my suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.22,1:29:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,[金屬拉伸聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[metallic straining]
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.01,1:29:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,聲納 到“別爾哥羅德”號的距離\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sonar, range to Belgorod.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.45,1:29:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,長官 我有近場效應 太近了 無法測算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, I have near-field effect. Too close to tell.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.06,1:29:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,機動 按計程儀減速至十節\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maneuvering, slow to ten knots by log.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.62,1:29:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,舵手 聽我口令 右滿舵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helm, on my mark, right full rudder.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.54,1:29:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等候您的口令 艦長\N{\fnArial\fs30}Standing by for your mark, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.69,1:29:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,[呼吸器嘶嘶作響]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[respirator hisses]
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.08,1:30:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,標記轉向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mark the turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.34,1:30:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 長官 我的舵是右滿舵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aye, sir. My rudder is right full.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.74,1:30:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一路順風 閣下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Godspeed, mister.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.95,1:31:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[呼吸器嘶嘶作響]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[respirator hisses]
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.70,1:37:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[無聲對白]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[no audible dialogue]
Dialogue: 0,1:37:37.15,1:37:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,[水流聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[water rushing]
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.24,1:39:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,[呼吸器嘶嘶作響]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[respirator hisses]
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.14,1:39:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,[氣流嘶嘶作響]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[air hisses]
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.96,1:41:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,[呼吸器嘶嘶作響]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[respirator hisses]
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.76,1:41:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,魚雷發射管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Torpedo tube.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.16,1:44:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,[瑟瑟發抖]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[shivering]
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.58,1:47:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[無聲對白]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[no audible dialogue]
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.34,1:48:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒事了 沒事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s okay. It’s okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.14,1:49:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.62,1:49:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,波德科瓦在哪？在這裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Podkova, where is it? Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.71,1:49:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.45,1:49:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.89,1:49:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那接下來怎麼辦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happens now?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.46,1:49:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.38,1:49:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們去找加百列\N{\fnArial\fs30}we find Gabriel.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.08,1:49:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到盧瑟的毒丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get Luther’s poison pill.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.78,1:49:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然後消滅智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we kill the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.34,1:49:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 我一直在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, I’ve been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.35,1:49:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們怎麼才能撤銷智體做過的一切？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we undo everything the Entity has done?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:40.05,1:49:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我們能控制它\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could control it,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.92,1:49:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也許就能把世界從邊緣拉回來\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe we could bring the world back from the brink.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.10,1:49:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾絲……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace…
Dialogue: 0,1:49:50.67,1:49:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底會把這麼大的權力交給誰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}who on earth would you ever trust with that much power?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.37,1:49:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 當然是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.93,1:50:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only you.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.63,1:50:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你註定要做這件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you were meant to do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.42,1:50:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:06.46,1:50:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.52,1:50:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,謝謝你……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you…
Dialogue: 0,1:50:18.30,1:50:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,帶我回來\N{\fnArial\fs30}for bringing me back.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.87,1:50:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,舉手之勞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.80,1:50:37.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,說來話長\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s a long story.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.31,1:51:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們還沒正式認識 我是——\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven’t been formally introduced. I’m…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.01,1:51:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·東洛 蘭利\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Donloe. Langley.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.97,1:51:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們三十年前見過\N{\fnArial\fs30}We met thirty years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:16.27,1:51:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.06,1:51:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you’re him.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.67,1:51:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我欠你一條命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand I owe you my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:29.55,1:51:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道要如何彌補我對你人生造成的傷害\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don’t know how to make amends for what I’ve done to yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.38,1:51:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,這取決於你怎麼看 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s a matter of perspective, friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:35.77,1:51:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你三十年前沒有闖入資料庫 我可能現在還在那兒\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you hadn’t broken in the vault 30 years ago, I’d probably still be there.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.51,1:51:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至可能覺得自己挺幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’d probably even think I was happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.26,1:51:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也絕不會找到這個真正給我帶來平靜的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never would have found the only home that’s ever brought me peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.87,1:51:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我當然也絕不會遇到我深愛的這個女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I certainly never would have met the woman I love.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.44,1:51:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒什麼好抱歉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s nothing to be sorry about.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:02.93,1:52:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你一條命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:15.03,1:52:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 我們將在時間耗盡時著陸\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] We’ll be landing just as the clock runs out.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.16,1:52:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我們到達時 智體將控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time we arrive, the Entity will have control.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.16,1:52:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球九個自動化末日武庫\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the world’s nine automated doomsday arsenals.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:21.77,1:52:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,並且它將為它控制的導彈加註燃料\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it will be fueling the missiles it controls.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.08,1:52:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果它想要生存 就得先找到一個能安全隱匿的地方 否則就無法發射\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it can’t launch until it has a safe place to hide if it wants to survive.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.65,1:52:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最安全的地方就是這裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The safest place is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.56,1:52:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什麼？末日金庫 剛果堯瓦\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? The Doomsday Vault. Kongo Yowa.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.74,1:52:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,[東洛] 這是一個絕密的、獨立的、靠太陽能供電的\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Donloe] It’s a top secret standalone, solar-powered,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.27,1:52:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,防電磁干擾的、A級\N{\fnArial\fs30}TEMPEST-hardened, Level A.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.23,1:52:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾位元組資料伺服器\N{\fnArial\fs30}exabyte data server.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.05,1:52:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,十億吉位元組的儲存空間\N{\fnArial\fs30}One billion gigabytes of storage.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.19,1:52:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,這能存好多家庭錄影 [東洛] 嗯 你猜得差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s a lot of home movies. [Donloe] Well, you’re not far off.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.75,1:52:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它包含所有被認為值得儲存的人類積累知識\N{\fnArial\fs30}It contains all the accumulated knowledge deemed worthy of preservation.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.97,1:52:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且它是完全遮蔽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it’s fully shielded.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.02,1:52:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 完全不受任何形式的電磁能量影響\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Totally impervious to electromagnetic energy of any kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:53.11,1:52:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒有任何資料進出\N{\fnArial\fs30}No transmissions in or out.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.63,1:52:56.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,[東洛] 一個不可篡改的人類歷史方舟\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Donloe] An incorruptible ark of human history.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.81,1:52:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,專為在世界末日中存活而建造\N{\fnArial\fs30}built to survive the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.68,1:53:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 如果智體鑽進那裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if the Entity got in there,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.94,1:53:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就能存活數千年\N{\fnArial\fs30}it could survive for thousands of years,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.29,1:53:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,無論世界其他地方發生什麼\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what happened to the rest of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.03,1:53:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德加] 為什麼它會想要生存？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Degas] And why would it want to survive?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.86,1:53:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,消滅地球上所有的生命對它有什麼好處？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it stand to gain from wiping out all life on Earth?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:09.69,1:53:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,諾亞和他的家人在大洪水前一定也問過這個問題\N{\fnArial\fs30}A question Noah and his family must have asked just before the flood.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.78,1:53:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 這個反上帝把自己當成了上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] The Anti-God thinks it’s God.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.91,1:53:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 我們怎麼消滅它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] How do we kill it?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:17.39,1:53:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,總是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.96,1:53:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,直奔主題 對吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}right to the point, aren’t you?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.66,1:53:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是包含盧瑟演算法的毒丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the poison pill containing Luther’s algorithm.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:25.92,1:53:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是“波德科瓦”\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is the Podkova,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:27.71,1:53:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,裡面則包含智體的原始程式碼\N{\fnArial\fs30}containing the Entity’s original source code.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.93,1:53:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,兩者結合 它們將形成一種數字毒素\N{\fnArial\fs30}When combined, they will form a sort of digital toxin.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:33.67,1:53:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,當上傳到網路空間時 這種毒素將攻擊智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}When uploaded to cyberspace, this toxin will attack the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:36.54,1:53:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,並改變它感知現實的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and alter its ability to perceive reality.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.20,1:53:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 將它與“波德科瓦”結合……\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, combine that with the Podkova…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.11,1:53:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們就能欺騙謊言之主\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can deceive the Lord of Lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.29,1:53:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 但是……\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] But…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:47.34,1:53:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,……總有個但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}…there’s always a but.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.82,1:53:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mais…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.25,1:53:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們沒有盧瑟的毒丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we don’t have Luther’s poison pill.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:51.78,1:53:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百列有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel does.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:54.04,1:53:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,這就是為什麼我們可以確信他在末日金庫等我們\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why we can be sure he’ll be waiting for us in the Doomsday Vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:56.87,1:53:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 一旦智體感染了盧瑟的演算法\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Once the Entity is infected with Luther’s algorithm,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:00.09,1:54:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,它會以為自己正在進入樞紐的中央資料伺服器\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will think it’s entering the junction’s central data server.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.79,1:54:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,而實際上它會去這裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it will actually be going here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.01,1:54:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.71,1:54:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 小心 這非常嬌貴\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Careful, it’s very delicate.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:09.79,1:54:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can’t be.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.58,1:54:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是一個 5D 光學資料驅動器\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s a 5D optical data drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:15.37,1:54:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,掌中可容納360太位元組\N{\fnArial\fs30}360 terabytes in the palm of your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.85,1:54:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,[東洛] 我以為這只是理論上的東西\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Donloe] I thought these were just theoretical.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.80,1:54:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,[Ethan] 曾經是\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] They were.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.98,1:54:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到盧瑟做了一個\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until Luther built one.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.86,1:54:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果智體是我們的燈神\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Entity is our genie,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.42,1:54:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那麼這個光學驅動器就是我們把它困進去的瓶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}then this optical drive is the bottle we’ll capture it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.43,1:54:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,這就引出了棘手的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which brings us to the tricky part.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.34,1:54:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦進去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once inside,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.34,1:54:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦它相信自己是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}once it believes that it’s safe,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.22,1:54:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體就會啟動核彈發射\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Entity will initiate a nuclear launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.05,1:54:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們必須在它這麼做之前拔掉這個驅動器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to disconnect this drive before it can do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.92,1:54:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們有多少時間？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long do we have?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.92,1:54:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,大約……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roughly…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.01,1:54:50.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,[兩人] 100毫秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}[both] 100 milliseconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.62,1:54:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,眨眼之間\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.53,1:54:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 如果我們動手太早……\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] If we do it too soon…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.53,1:54:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們就困不住燈神\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won’t trap the genie in the bottle.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.36,1:54:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 如果我們動手太晚……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. And if we do it too late…
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.32,1:55:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們就阻止不了智體發射\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won’t prevent the Entity from launching.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.67,1:55:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,無論如何……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:02.37,1:55:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,[東洛] 如果我們在錯誤的時間拔下驅動器\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Donloe] If we pull the drive at the wrong time,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.20,1:55:05.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體就贏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Entity wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.85,1:55:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 祝你好運\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:07.59,1:55:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 如果末日金庫有電子遮蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. If the Doomsday Vault is electronically shielded,
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.90,1:55:12.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體怎麼進去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}how does the Entity expect to get in?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.51,1:55:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,它指望我們放它進去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It expects us to let it in.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.34,1:55:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像加百列指望我交出“波德科瓦”一樣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like Gabriel expects me to hand over the Podkova.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.56,1:55:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,顯而易見 這兩件事我們都不會做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither of which we’d ever do, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:22.00,1:55:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,對吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.65,1:55:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 金庫有電子遮蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it. The vault is electronically shielded.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.04,1:55:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何訊號都進不去出不來\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signals get in or out.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:28.61,1:55:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,必須有人走到金庫外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone has to go outside the vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.35,1:55:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能把盧瑟的毒丸上傳給智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to upload Luther’s poison pill to the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.58,1:55:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且如果加百列想控制智體……\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if Gabriel wants to control the Entity…
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.41,1:55:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就必須上傳盧瑟的毒丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to upload Luther’s poison pill.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:44.45,1:55:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是真打算把“波德科瓦”交給他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’re not seriously gonna give him the Podkova.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.67,1:55:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,還讓他帶著毒丸逃跑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let him get away with the pill.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.55,1:55:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,這正是我打算做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s exactly what I’m going to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.51,1:55:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百列會成為團隊的一員 而他自己卻渾然不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel will be part of the team and never know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:55.86,1:55:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,這太瘋狂了！你在把智體放進金庫\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s insane! You’re letting the Entity into the vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:59.12,1:56:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,這正是它想讓你做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s precisely what it wants you to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:01.25,1:56:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,“命中註定 ”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"It is written."
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.69,1:56:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.00,1:56:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是我們戰勝加百列和智體的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it’s the only chance we have.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.00,1:56:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一機會\N{\fnArial\fs30}of beating Gabriel and the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.35,1:56:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,萬億分之一的機會\N{\fnArial\fs30}One chance in a trillion.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:09.78,1:56:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 想想你在幹什麼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, think about what you’re doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:12.05,1:56:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你是怎麼走到這一步的 想想世界是怎麼走到這一步的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about how you got here. Think about how the world got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:15.75,1:56:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎麼知道智體不是故意讓你找回“波德科瓦”的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know that the Entity didn’t want you to recover the Podkova?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.36,1:56:20.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,也許它告訴你這是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it told you it was impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:21.10,1:56:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,因為它知道那是你想聽的話！\N{\fnArial\fs30}because it knew that was the thing that you needed to hear!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.02,1:56:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是這麼想的嗎 格蕾絲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you think, Grace?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.84,1:56:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我認為你是在拿世界的命運\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you’re risking the fate of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.98,1:56:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及數十億人的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}and billions of lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:32.42,1:56:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,去賭一個眨眼的瞬間\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.16,1:56:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 格蕾絲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.64,1:56:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是在賭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:38.46,1:56:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,若有別的選擇 我就會去選那個\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if there was another choice, I’d take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.64,1:56:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你們都有所懷疑 我不怪你們\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you all have your doubts. I don’t blame you.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.78,1:56:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我們必須團結一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.91,1:56:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們必須確保由格蕾絲\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have to make sure that Grace.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.48,1:56:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,來拔下那個驅動器\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the one to disconnect that drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:53.39,1:56:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.35,1:56:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一個優秀的扒手和一個偉大的扒手有什麼區別？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What separates a good pickpocket from a great one?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.58,1:57:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,時機\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timing.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.71,1:57:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,眨眼之間\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:38.96,1:57:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 大家都去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:40.92,1:57:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們知道要發生什麼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know what’s coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.88,1:57:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他們都回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They’ve all gone home.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.56,1:58:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,[安斯特朗] 我們無法準確預測智體現在的移動速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Angstrom] We can’t accurately predict how fast the Entity is moving now.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:56.60,1:58:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士 亨特失蹤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, Hunt is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.26,1:59:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他沒死 他就落入俄羅斯人手裡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he isn’t dead, the Russians have him.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.69,1:59:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我們失去了對核武庫的控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we lose control of our arsenal,
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.83,1:59:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們就徹底失去了阻止智體發射的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}we lose any hope of preventing the Entity from launching.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:06.44,1:59:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們時間不多了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are out of time!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:12.23,1:59:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,西德尼將軍……\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Sidney…
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.79,1:59:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們最有限的打擊選擇是什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what is our most limited attack option?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:17.49,1:59:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西德尼] 外科手術式核打擊\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Sidney] Surgical nuclear strikes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:19.36,1:59:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嚴格限定在受智體控制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}confined strictly to the command centers of the eight nations.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.50,1:59:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,八個國家的指揮中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}under the Entity’s control.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.20,1:59:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,北京 伊斯蘭堡 倫敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beijing. Islamabad. London.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.98,1:59:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯科 新德里 巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moscow. New Delhi. Paris.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.38,1:59:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,平壤 以及特拉維夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pyongyang. And Tel Aviv.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.07,1:59:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,傷亡情況\N{\fnArial\fs30}Casualties.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.99,1:59:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,初次打擊的估計死亡人數\N{\fnArial\fs30}Estimated death tolls from initial strikes.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.65,1:59:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,當然 隨後的核沉降物還會造成更多傷亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And more later, of course, from the resulting nuclear fallout.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.87,1:59:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,估計數字……呃 有所不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Estimates, uh… vary.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.18,1:59:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,顯然 轟炸八個不同國家的主要城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously the bombing of major cities in eight different countries.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:53.36,1:59:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,會引發前所未有的政治危機\N{\fnArial\fs30}would create an unprecedented political crisis.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:56.27,2:00:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,這種危機很可能會導致一場持久的全球戰爭\N{\fnArial\fs30}One that would likely lead to a protracted global war.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.71,2:00:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,從外交角度來看 做出一個……\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may be diplomatically prudent to make a…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:06.32,2:00:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,姿態或許是明智的\N{\fnArial\fs30}gesture.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.37,2:00:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一個姿態？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gesture?
Dialogue: 0,2:00:11.29,2:00:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,犧牲我們國內的一座城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sacrifice one of our cities here at home.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.51,2:00:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們已經擬好了一份名單\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’ve prepared a list.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.73,2:00:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,[安斯特朗] 城市是按戰略和經濟重要性排列的\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Angstrom] Cities have been arranged by strategic and economic importance.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.08,2:00:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,還有……\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.48,2:00:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,……當然還有人口\N{\fnArial\fs30}…population, of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:28.09,2:00:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們要犧牲一億人的生命……\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’d be sacrificing a hundred million lives…
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.48,2:00:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,來拯救七十億人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save seven billion.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.22,2:00:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,這不可能發生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can’t be happening.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.14,2:00:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,[西德尼] 總統女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Sidney] Madam President,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:39.53,2:00:42.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們現在身處智體的現實之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are in the Entity’s reality now.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:42.40,2:00:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,將死\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:51.76,2:00:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,[重重腳步聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[stomps]
Dialogue: 0,2:01:02.51,2:01:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,砲兵中士 把你的配槍給我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gunnery Sergeant, I need your sidearm.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.52,2:01:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,長官？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.99,2:01:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,聽見我的話了 孩子 交出來\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me, son. Hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.71,2:01:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,主伺服器就在那邊\N{\fnArial\fs30}The main server’s through there.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:27.97,2:01:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉 格蕾絲 你們跟我來\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Benji, Grace, you come with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.32,2:01:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們其他人 就在這等著\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of you, you just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:33.15,2:01:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Non.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.41,2:01:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 加百列在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] Gabriel is down there.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.33,2:01:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,讓我跟你們一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me come with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:38.72,2:01:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的死期還沒到\N{\fnArial\fs30}His time will come.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:04.22,2:02:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是伺服器室的門\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s the door to the server room.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:06.44,2:02:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,太暴露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s too exposed.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.45,2:02:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你應該回其他人那邊去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should go back to the others.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.58,2:02:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,若加百列藏在裡面 你進去只有死路一條\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Gabriel is in there, he’ll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:13.67,2:02:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必須帶著毒丸和“波德科瓦”離開這裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has to leave here with the pill and the Podkova.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:17.72,2:02:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是可有可無的 你們倆都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m expendable. Neither of you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:21.63,2:02:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他說得對\N{\fnArial\fs30}He’s right.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.51,2:02:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,照顧好你的團隊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care of your team.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:22.69,2:03:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[加百列] 你的最終清算！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Gabriel] Your final reckoning!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.06,2:03:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,三千萬噸當量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty megaton yield.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:46.11,2:03:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人一鬆開那個按鈕 智體就無處可藏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My man lets go of that button and the Entity has no place to hide.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.37,2:03:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happens to you?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.42,2:03:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有一架飛機能帶我到絕對安全距離\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a plane that’ll take me to minimum safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:56.34,2:04:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠譜、類比 而且不會被雷達偵測到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reliable, analog, under the radar.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:00.25,2:04:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至帶了備用的 以防萬一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even brought a spare. Just in case.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.52,2:04:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真覺得毀了這裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you honestly believe destroying this place.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:06.04,2:04:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能阻止智體發射嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}will stop the Entity from launching.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.70,2:04:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我覺得它在虛張聲勢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it’s bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:09.35,2:04:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果無法生存 它就不會毀滅世界；\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won’t end the world if it can’t survive,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.26,2:04:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,而如果你不放它進去 它就無法生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it can’t survive if you don’t let it in.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:13.44,2:04:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在把“波德科瓦”交出來\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now hand over the Podkova.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:15.57,2:04:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I’ll let you walk away.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.23,2:04:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我憑什麼相信你？因為我希望你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I believe that? Because I want you.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.49,2:04:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你在乎的每個人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everyone you care about.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.02,2:04:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我創造的世界裡長命百歲\N{\fnArial\fs30}to live long lives in the world I create.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:26.32,2:04:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,到時候智體將聽命於我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the Entity answers to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.80,2:04:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你輸了 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}You’re beat, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.50,2:04:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,縱使躲過今天 改天換個地方你依然逃不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not today, some other place, some other time.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.33,2:04:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我擁有這個\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I have this,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.60,2:04:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,無論我走到哪 你都會跟到哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}wherever I go, you will follow.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.77,2:04:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而“波德科瓦”終究會落入我手中\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Podkova will come to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.47,2:04:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是命中註定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is written.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.43,2:04:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切皆非命中註定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is written.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.69,2:04:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看盧瑟未必會同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m not sure Luther would agree.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.70,2:04:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.13,2:04:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,告訴我你贏了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me I win!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:06.76,2:05:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你贏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:07.89,2:05:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜歡聽這話\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the sound of that.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:10.54,2:05:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,再說一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it again.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:12.20,2:05:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.28,2:05:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:14.81,2:05:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,雙手舉到我看得見的地方 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands where I can see them, dickhead.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.67,2:05:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出來\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let’s have it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:51.32,2:05:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,還有多少時間？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:52.54,2:05:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,18分鐘\N{\fnArial\fs30}18 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:58.76,2:05:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我認識你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.94,2:06:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,東洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Donloe.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:01.37,2:06:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉·東洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}William Donloe.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:02.85,2:06:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的妻子 塔皮莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife, Tapeesa.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:05.20,2:06:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不得不佩服你 亨特 你組建的這支隊伍真是頂尖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to hand it to you, Hunt. This is one crackerjack unit you’ve put together.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:09.08,2:06:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢說這會兒智體正在其虛擬短褲裡嚇得瑟瑟發抖\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m imagining the Entity is shaking in its virtual shorts right about now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.43,2:06:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我究竟需要了解什麼？到底是哪套方案？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I need to know about this, and what exactly was the play?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.43,2:06:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,當前唯一策略就是把它親手交給他 並當場讓他離開\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only play is to give that to him, and let him go right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.74,2:06:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想讓我把它交給他然後放他走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to give this to him and let him go.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.40,2:06:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 馬上 [基特里奇] 馬上\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] Right now. [Kittridge] Right now.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.92,2:06:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,馬上 馬上……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now. Right now…
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.14,2:06:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,美國總統\N{\fnArial\fs30}the President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.19,2:06:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,正準備將數以百萬計的生命從人間蒸發\N{\fnArial\fs30}is preparing to vaporize millions upon millions of souls.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.01,2:06:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,全是因為這裡的伊森不相信任何人能安全地控制智體\N{\fnArial\fs30}All because Ethan here doesn’t believe that anyone can safely control the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.59,2:06:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,這聽起來正常嗎？任何人覺得正常嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that sound sane? To anyone?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.50,2:06:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,也許你應該去問問“塞瓦斯托波爾”號的船員\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should ask the crew of the Sevastopol.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.90,2:06:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,還有多少時間？17分鐘 長官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time? 17 minutes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:47.94,2:06:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,基特里奇 如果伊森沒有計劃 你不會站在這\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kittridge. You wouldn’t be here if Ethan didn’t have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:51.08,2:06:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,誰能告訴我那個計劃是什麼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whomever tells me what that plan is.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.69,2:06:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能拯救數百萬人的生命 你也能免於其他人的命運\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be sparing millions of lives, and you’ll be spared the fate of the others.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:57.56,2:06:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,長官 我們時間不多了 我們得去絕對安全距離\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we’re running out of time. We need to get to a minimum safe distance.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.96,2:07:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們為什麼還站在這？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we still standing here?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.35,2:07:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,因為他在這裡 他就在這裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he’s here and he’s here.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:04.26,2:07:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,這意味著某種東西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this means something.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:07.31,2:07:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,隨時\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any second now.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:08.96,2:07:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森就會告訴我它是什麼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan’s gonna tell me what it is.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.92,2:07:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我認識這人很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’ve known this man for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:14.62,2:07:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他絕不會讓他的寶貴團隊受到任何傷害\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he won’t want anything to happen to his precious team.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:24.33,2:07:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,這就是模式 對吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that’s the pattern, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.98,2:07:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拒絕犧牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}You refuse to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:30.12,2:07:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你親近的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ones you hold close.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.86,2:07:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,這就是為什麼我們還站在這\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why we’re still here.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:38.21,2:07:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,結束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s over.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.69,2:07:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,這沒什麼好羞恥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s no shame in it.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:41.87,2:07:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在只需……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now just…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:44.00,2:07:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,告訴我我漏掉了什麼\N{\fnArial\fs30}tell me what I’m missing.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:45.96,2:07:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,時間\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:02.32,2:08:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 就是現在！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Now!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.15,2:08:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[槍聲]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[gunfire]
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.30,2:08:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,加百列！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gabriel!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:24.69,2:08:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕里斯 加百列在那！動手殺了他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris, Gabriel now! Kill him now!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:27.74,2:08:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[發動機轟鳴]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[engine revs]
Dialogue: 0,2:08:31.92,2:08:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,德加！加百列！開槍打他 開槍打他 弄死他！弄死他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Degas! Gabriel! Shoot him, shoot him, kill him! Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.40,2:08:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,有本事就來抓我 伊森！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catch me if you can, Ethan!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.45,2:08:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去追他把毒丸拿回來\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go after him and get the pill.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:41.36,2:08:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們去伺服器室放智體進來\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’ll get to the server room and let the Entity in.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:47.19,2:08:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森 我們會想辦法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan, we’ll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.06,2:08:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘了那枚炸彈 核炸彈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are forgetting the bomb. The nuclear bomb.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:51.76,2:08:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們會想辦法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’ll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.59,2:08:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森！班吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan!Benji.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:54.81,2:08:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧！這裡交給我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! I got this.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:56.38,2:08:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:01.21,2:09:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,眨眼之間\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.56,2:09:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,[伊森] 帕里斯！掩護 掩護！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Ethan] Paris! Cover, cover!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:13.35,2:09:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunt!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.83,2:09:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我還以為他不會走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he’d never leave.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.80,2:09:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們會想辦法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’ll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:27.23,2:09:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,[發動機轟鳴]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[engine revs]
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.72,2:09:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們得走了 布里格斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to go, Briggs.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:35.02,2:09:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,自求多福吧 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s your funeral. Let’s go.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:58.21,2:11:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有辦法解除武裝\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has to be a way to disarm it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:00.08,2:12:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你能阻止它核爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you can prevent it from going nuclear,
Dialogue: 0,2:12:01.73,2:12:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也阻止不了那些雷管爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can’t stop those detonators from exploding.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:04.00,2:12:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們能在伺服器室的爆炸中倖存嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we survive the blast from the server room?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:05.96,2:12:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非有人留下來阻止炸彈達到臨界狀態\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only if someone stays behind and stops the bomb from going critical.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.09,2:12:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那人是誰 都絕不可能生還了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whoever that is, they’re not going to make it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:14.01,2:12:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 誰能倖免於難 誰又將命喪黃泉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] Who will live and who will die?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:19.93,2:12:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸彈交給我們 你們其他人帶班吉去伺服器室\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’ll handle the bomb. The rest of you get Benji to the server room.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.80,2:12:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,沒時間討論了 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s no time to discuss it. Go.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.41,2:12:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,[因紐特語] 我們還會再見面的\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in Inuktitut] I will see you again.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.59,2:12:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 按住傷口\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Keep pressure on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.03,2:12:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲] 我按住了 我按住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace] I’ve got it. I’ve got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.81,2:12:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留下來陪他們\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’ll stay with them.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:38.47,2:12:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在伺服器室也幫不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s nothing for me to do in the server room.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:41.99,2:12:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好運\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:44.65,2:12:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好運\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.09,2:14:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪學的這手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where’d you learn to do this?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:16.48,2:14:18.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可沒說我會\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never said I did.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.11,2:14:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,這可不妙 是什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not good. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.50,2:14:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我沒猜錯 是張力性氣胸\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had to guess, it’s a tension pneumothorax.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:42.03,2:14:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什麼意思？胸膜腔內壓力積聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean? Pressure building in the pleural cavity.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:45.55,2:14:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的肺部塌陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lung is collapsing.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:47.42,2:14:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我們不快點行動 就會窒息或心搏驟停\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we don’t act fast, it means suffocation or cardiac arrest.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.21,2:14:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你們倆誰有醫療經驗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do either of you have any medical experience?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.91,2:14:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 我殺人\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] I kill people.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.30,2:14:58.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,這我能用得上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can work with that.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.78,2:15:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾絲 我要你入侵伺服器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace, I need you to hack the server.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:00.61,2:15:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,這樣我們就能放智體進來了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can let the Entity in.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.39,2:15:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿上工具 去控制面板 帕里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the tools, head to the panel. Paris.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.83,2:15:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 你得給我做手術\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] You have to operate on me.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:06.09,2:15:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moi?
Dialogue: 0,2:15:08.44,2:15:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,[英語] 首先我需要你堵住彈孔 做到不透氣\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in English] First I need you to plug the bullet hole, make it airtight.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.10,2:15:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 把它封緊\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] Close it tight.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:12.32,2:15:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,繃帶\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bandage.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:13.58,2:15:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,請給我繃帶\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bandage please.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:10.81,2:16:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我進去了 我該怎麼做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m in. What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:12.90,2:16:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾絲 我需要你找到電源開關……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grace, I need you to find the power switch…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:14.81,2:16:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,……連到伺服器的內部網路\N{\fnArial\fs30}…to the server’s internal network.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.38,2:16:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了 帕里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. Paris.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.03,2:16:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 我的鎖骨……數到我的第二根肋骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] My clavicle… count down to my second rib.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.78,2:16:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:24.52,2:16:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,……切個口子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…make an incision.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:33.40,2:16:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿住這個\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.66,2:16:38.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paris.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.19,2:16:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 會沒事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] It’s going to be OK.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:41.19,2:16:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,一口氣喝光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottoms up.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:48.41,2:16:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:50.50,2:16:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,筆……在包裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pen… in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.59,2:16:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,壓力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressure.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.16,2:16:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拆開\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it apart.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:54.68,2:16:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,[英語] 格蕾絲 你找到開關了嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in English] Grace, did you find the switch?
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.68,2:16:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了 [班吉] 好 把它關掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. [Benji] Okay, shut it off.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.73,2:17:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲] 接下來呢？開啟面板\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace] What next? Open the panel.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.73,2:17:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 現在呢？[英語] 把這個插進切口裡\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] Now what? [in English] Push that into the incision.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.91,2:17:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.87,2:17:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,[法語] 謝謝\N{\fnArial\fs30}[in French] Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:20.44,2:17:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,謝天謝地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.14,2:17:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,德加 裡面情況怎麼樣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Degas, how’s it going in there?
Dialogue: 0,2:17:24.06,2:17:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 這裡一切都在掌控之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, everything’s under control here.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:26.36,2:17:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 把這個拿穩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hold this very steady.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:29.41,2:17:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但別把它拔出來\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don’t pull it out.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:54.30,2:17:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,[加百列] 就像我說的 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Gabriel] It’s like I said, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:58.74,2:18:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我有毒丸……\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I have the pill…
Dialogue: 0,2:18:01.70,2:18:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,“波德科瓦”就會主動來找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Podkova will come to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:54.32,2:18:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 什麼？怎麼了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. What? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:56.37,2:18:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們或許有辦法脫困\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may have a way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:58.72,2:19:01.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,這些地線是三重冗餘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}These ground wires are triple redundant.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:01.55,2:19:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我們同時切斷其中任意三根\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we cut any three of them simultaneously,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:03.90,2:19:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能延遲這些雷管爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could delay these detonators from exploding.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:06.59,2:19:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,或許能爭取足夠的時間讓人趕到伺服器室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe long enough for someone to make it to the server room.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:08.94,2:19:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:11.38,2:19:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒 也許吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:14.52,2:19:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你覺得你能在十秒內跑到那扇門嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can make it to that door in ten seconds?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:19.82,2:19:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,試過才知道 把棘輪扳手給我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one way to find out. Hand me the ratchet.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:22.39,2:19:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我進去了 接下來呢？[班吉] 我們還沒脫險呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I’m in. What now? [Benji] We’re not out of the woods yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:25.74,2:19:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,隨時我的血壓會驟降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any minute now, my blood pressure’s gonna drop drastically.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:27.83,2:19:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我會暈過去 所以我們得快點\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I’ll grow faint, so we need to work fast.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:31.05,2:19:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,工具包裡有個接收器 一個帶兩個燈的銀色盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There’s a receiver in the tool bag. A silver box with two lights on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:34.49,2:19:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:36.23,2:19:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們需要把它接進伺服器的太陽能板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to splice that into the server’s solar panels.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:37.58,2:19:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,做成一個天線\N{\fnArial\fs30}and make an antenna.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:38.67,2:19:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,這樣我們就能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way we’ll know.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:40.11,2:19:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森什麼時候上傳毒丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}when Ethan’s uploading the poison pill.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:41.72,2:19:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,對 懂了 現在是最棘手的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Got it. Now this is the really tricky part.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:43.85,2:19:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,右下角有一捆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a bundle of blue, black, and red cables.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:46.37,2:19:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,藍色、黑色和紅色的電纜\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the lower right corner.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:48.33,2:19:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 告訴我怎麼做\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Walk me through it.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:50.33,2:19:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你按特定順序剪斷其中兩根線\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m gonna need you to cut two of the wires in a specific order,
Dialogue: 0,2:19:53.12,2:19:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但無論你做什麼 千萬別剪……\N{\fnArial\fs30}but whatever you do, do not cut…
Dialogue: 0,2:19:59.60,2:20:01.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,班吉！……紅色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Benji! …the red ones.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:03.56,2:20:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,[瑟林] 總統女士 作為您的國防部長\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Serling] Madam President, as your Secretary of Defense.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:06.70,2:20:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我請您注意CONPLAN 8044計劃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I direct your attention to CONPLAN 8044,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:10.57,2:20:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,選定的打擊方案9.1\N{\fnArial\fs30}selected Attack Option 9.1.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.36,2:20:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,對受智體控制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A targeted nuclear strike on the command centers.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:16.10,2:20:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有八個國家的指揮中心進行有針對性的核打擊\N{\fnArial\fs30}of all eight nations now controlled by the Entity.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.41,2:20:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,經修正後包括您選定要犧牲的那座美國城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amended to include the American city you’ve chosen to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:25.32,2:20:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,「The Biscuit」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Biscuit.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:39.64,2:20:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你兒子談過嗎？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you spoken to your son?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:43.47,2:20:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能跟他說什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would I tell him?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:45.61,2:20:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,[瑟林] 身份驗證碼已確認\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Serling] Authentication code verified.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:52.05,2:20:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:04.89,2:21:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:06.50,2:21:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,認輸吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Know when you’re beat.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:08.02,2:21:10.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不了多久你的人就全死光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any minute now your team will be dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.63,2:21:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體也將無處可藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Entity will have no place to hide.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:27.87,2:21:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,[加百列] 我會把你逼入絕境\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Gabriel] I’m gonna run you into the ground.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:30.00,2:21:32.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,“波德科瓦”將歸我所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Podkova will be mine.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:32.65,2:21:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,智體也將聽命於我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Entity will answer to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:35.48,2:21:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,這只是時間問題\N{\fnArial\fs30}It’s only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.40,2:21:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,[格蕾絲] 哎喲 [德加] 格蕾絲 我們覺得\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Grace] Ow. [Degas] Grace, we think.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:40.97,2:21:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們可以阻止這枚炸彈發生核爆\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can prevent this bomb from going nuclear,
Dialogue: 0,2:21:42.36,2:21:43.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但所有這些雷管都會爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}but all of these detonators will explode.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:43.66,2:21:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,多大威力的爆炸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How big a blast?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:45.67,2:21:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們說的是多大威力的爆炸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How big a blast are we talking?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:48.97,2:21:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德加] 很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Degas] Big.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:50.63,2:21:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們得盡可能幫伊森爭取時間\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan needs all the time we can give him.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.50,2:21:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非萬不得已 千萬不要剪斷最後一根線\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not make the last cut until we absolutely have to.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:01.03,2:22:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President,
Dialogue: 0,2:22:02.73,2:22:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,發射已啟用\N{\fnArial\fs30}launch is now enabled.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:33.58,2:22:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在幹什麼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:35.24,2:22:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,做我們本該一開始就做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we should have done in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:38.37,2:22:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,命令美國戰略指揮中心切斷電源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order U.S. Strategic Command Center to cut their power.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:43.07,2:22:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我們的導彈全部離線\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take our missiles offline entirely.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:46.38,2:22:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,關閉所有系統\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut everything down.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:48.47,2:22:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士 那會使國家完全失去防禦能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, that would leave the country completely defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:51.91,2:22:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但能剝奪智體訪問地球上最大核武庫的許可權\N{\fnArial\fs30}But deny the Entity access to the largest nuclear arsenal on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:56.48,2:22:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,現在 打電話吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, make the call.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.96,2:22:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 謝天謝地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.39,2:23:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,長官 我們是地球上唯一一個\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma’am, We are the only nation on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:01.09,2:23:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有能力攻擊智體的國家！\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the power to attack the Entity!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:03.22,2:23:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而現在我們是世界上唯一一個有權做出選擇的國家\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we’re the only nation in the world with the power of choice.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:05.88,2:23:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天我選擇不發起攻擊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today I choose not to attack.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:08.14,2:23:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士 請三思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President, think this through.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:09.88,2:23:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在犯一個可怕的錯誤！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are making a terrible mistake!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:11.93,2:23:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,為了國家利益 請聽從理智\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the sake of the country, please listen to reason.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:14.23,2:23:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在這麼做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That’s precisely what I’m doing.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:15.67,2:23:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我和戰略指揮部總部連線\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connect me with Strategic Command HQ.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:18.06,2:23:20.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[瑟林] 夫人 如果您不按下那個按鈕 數百萬人會死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Serling] Millions of people will die, ma’am, if you don’t push that button.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:20.50,2:23:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,[沃爾特斯] 如果她按了 會有更多數百萬人死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Walters] And millions of other people will die if she does!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:22.41,2:23:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什麼賦予我們決定誰生誰死的權利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What give us the right to decide who lives and who dies?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:24.37,2:23:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,[瑟林] 她宣誓過擔任美利堅合眾國總統\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Serling] She took an oath as President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:26.51,2:23:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們發射二十分鐘後 這些都不重要了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty minutes after we launch, none of that will matter!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:29.16,2:23:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我傾向於同意總統的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I’m inclined to agree with the President.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:31.34,2:23:34.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,夫人 在我們站在這裡爭論的時候 智體正準備發動攻擊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}While we stand here arguing, the Entity is preparing to attack, ma’am!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:34.34,2:23:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,諸位可以選擇生活在智體的現實中 我不選\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may choose to live in the Entity’s reality, gentlemen. I don’t.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:38.39,2:23:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,請接通總統\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold for the President.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:39.95,2:23:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,奧弗頓將軍辦公室 戰略指揮部\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Overton’s office, Strategic Command.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.09,2:23:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,奧弗頓將軍 我是總統 有一項非同尋常的命令要下達\N{\fnArial\fs30}General Overton, this is the President calling with an unorthodox command.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:46.13,2:23:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你非常仔細地聽好我的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to listen to my instructions very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:48.83,2:23:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,毫不猶豫地嚴格執行\N{\fnArial\fs30}and follow them to the letter without hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:58.63,2:24:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,[眾人] 總統女士？我沒事 我沒事\N{\fnArial\fs30}[all] Madam President? I’m fine. I’m fine.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:15.99,2:24:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,將軍！\N{\fnArial\fs30}General!
Dialogue: 0,2:24:19.65,2:24:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,總統女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam President.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:31.01,2:24:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,[警報鳴響]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[alarm blares]
Dialogue: 0,2:25:07.43,2:25:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,到現在為止 智體應該已經在給導彈加註燃料了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Entity will be fueling its missiles by now,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:09.70,2:25:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它在發射前仍然需要一個藏身之所\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it still needs a place to hide before it launches.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:12.09,2:25:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,格蕾絲 跟我說 好了 我收到訊號了 完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me, Grace. I’ve got it. It’s done.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:14.66,2:25:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,接收器已連線\N{\fnArial\fs30}Receiver’s connected.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:16.01,2:25:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我們開始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:17.40,2:25:18.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們要把電源重新開啟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’re gonna switch the power back on.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:22.06,2:25:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,接收器已啟用 紅燈亮起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Receiver’s activated. Red light is on.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:23.67,2:25:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,德加 情況怎麼樣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Degas, how we doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:25.19,2:25:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我們在拆除最後一個雷管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. We’re extracting the last detonator.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:26.76,2:25:27.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們準備剪斷導火索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We’re ready to cut the fuses.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:27.84,2:25:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒計時四分鐘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four minutes on the clock.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:29.45,2:25:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白 四分鐘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood. Four minutes.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:31.11,2:25:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,插入驅動器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Insert the drive.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:32.89,2:25:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,[裝置發出提示音] [格蕾絲] 準備好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[device chimes] [Grace] Ready.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:34.76,2:25:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 現在 你要盯著接收器上的燈\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Now, you’re gonna watch the lights on the receiver.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:37.07,2:25:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,當紅燈變成——\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the red light turns…
Dialogue: 0,2:25:40.12,2:25:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什麼？抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:42.12,2:25:43.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,當紅燈變成綠色時\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the red light turns green,
Dialogue: 0,2:25:44.17,2:25:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就會知道伊森已經把毒丸連線到“波德科瓦”上\N{\fnArial\fs30}you’ll know Ethan has connected the pill to the Podkova.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:47.39,2:25:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,並且智體已經感染了盧瑟的演算法\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Entity has been infected with Luther’s algorithm.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:49.87,2:25:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 然後呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Then what?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:51.74,2:25:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,然後你就要剪斷那根紅線 把智體放進來\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you’re gonna cut that red wire and let the Entity in.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:56.09,2:25:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們現在唯一需要的就是伊森拿到那個毒丸\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need now is for Ethan to get that pill.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.88,2:26:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他會想辦法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He’ll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:26.05,2:27:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:27:36.89,2:27:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,[發動機轟鳴]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[engine whining]
Dialogue: 0,2:28:04.52,2:28:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,[發動機轟鳴]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[engine revs]
Dialogue: 0,2:28:36.77,2:28:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,[費力喘息]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[strains]
Dialogue: 0,2:29:14.16,2:29:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,[無聲對白]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[no audible dialogue]
Dialogue: 0,2:30:30.23,2:30:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們只有一個人有降落傘！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one of us has a parachute!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:33.32,2:30:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好運！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,2:30:44.90,2:30:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,[發動機尖嘯 熄火]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[engine whines, stalls]
Dialogue: 0,2:31:20.54,2:31:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,[東洛] 我們快沒時間了\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Donloe] We’re almost out of time.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:22.33,2:31:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,剩10秒時我開始倒數三個數\N{\fnArial\fs30}At 10 seconds I’m gonna count backwards from three.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:25.07,2:31:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,三 二 一 剪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one, cut.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:27.60,2:31:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,然後拼命朝那扇門跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we run like hell for that door.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:29.51,2:31:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,[班吉] 記住 當那個驅動器亮起時\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Benji] Remember, when that drive lights up.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:31.73,2:31:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就知道智體進來了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you’ll know the Entity’s inside.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:33.56,2:31:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有100毫秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have 100 milliseconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:36.69,2:31:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,眨眼之間\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blink of an eye.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:40.28,2:32:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪 伊森？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you, Ethan?
Dialogue: 0,2:33:05.00,2:33:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊森！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ethan!
Dialogue: 0,2:34:39.70,2:34:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是總統\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the President.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:52.28,2:34:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it.
Dialogue: 0,2:34:56.89,2:35:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,這個混蛋居然真的成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That son of a bitch actually did it.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:25.88,2:35:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,[錄音裡的盧瑟] 嗨 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther on recording] Hello, brother.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:30.14,2:35:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你聽到這段話\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you’re listening to this,
Dialogue: 0,2:35:32.58,2:35:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,這個世界依然存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}the world is still here.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:34.80,2:35:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你也安然無恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so are you.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:37.37,2:35:41.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白說 我從未有過一絲懷疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the record, I never had a moment of doubt.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:43.02,2:35:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你能找到出路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you’d find a way.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:47.38,2:35:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你總是能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always do.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:51.82,2:35:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望假以時日你能明白 這種生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope in time you can see this life.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:55.30,2:35:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,並非常態下的偶然命運\N{\fnArial\fs30}was not some quirk of fate.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:58.52,2:36:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,這是你的天職\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your calling.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:01.70,2:36:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的宿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your destiny.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:03.74,2:36:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,一種關乎每一個生靈的宿命\N{\fnArial\fs30}A destiny that touches every living thing.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:10.23,2:36:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,無論願不願意 我們都是自身命運的主宰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not, we are masters of our fate.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:15.71,2:36:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,絕非命中註定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing is written.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:21.19,2:36:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我們的事業\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our cause,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:23.63,2:36:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,無論再正義\N{\fnArial\fs30}however righteous,
Dialogue: 0,2:36:25.20,2:36:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不及\N{\fnArial\fs30}pales in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:27.50,2:36:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們行為所產生的影響\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the impact.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:29.42,2:36:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,來得更加深遠\N{\fnArial\fs30}of our effect.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:34.55,2:36:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,對美好未來的任何期望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any hope for a better future.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:37.17,2:36:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都源於憑意志讓那未來成為現實\N{\fnArial\fs30}comes from willing that future into being.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:40.60,2:36:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一個能反映我們內心善念程度的未來\N{\fnArial\fs30}A future reflecting the measure of good within ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:46.39,2:36:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,火控！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire control!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:47.92,2:36:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,[盧瑟] 而我們內心深處的一切良善……\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther] And all that is good inside us…
Dialogue: 0,2:36:50.13,2:36:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,解除戒備\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:51.40,2:36:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,[路瑟] ……是以我們帶給他人的福祉來衡量\N{\fnArial\fs30}[Luther] …is measured by the good.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:53.75,2:36:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,為他人所做的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}we do for others.
Dialogue: 0,2:36:58.97,2:37:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們共享著同樣的命運\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all share the same fate,
Dialogue: 0,2:37:01.54,2:37:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,同樣的未來\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same future.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:07.11,2:37:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們無數選擇的總和\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sum of our infinite choices.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:12.46,2:37:15.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一種未來建立在善良、信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}One such future is built on kindness, trust.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:16.12,2:37:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及相互理解之上……\N{\fnArial\fs30}and mutual understanding…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:22.04,2:37:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我們選擇\N{\fnArial\fs30}should we choose.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:23.56,2:37:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,接受它\N{\fnArial\fs30}to accept it.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:28.91,2:37:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不加質疑地往前衝……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Driving without question…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:32.74,2:37:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝著一束我們看不見的光\N{\fnArial\fs30}towards a light we cannot see.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:38.79,2:37:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不僅為了我們珍視之人……\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just for those we hold close…
Dialogue: 0,2:37:45.36,2:37:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 媽媽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:46.89,2:37:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,……更為了那些我們永遠無緣相見的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but for those we’ll never meet.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:53.63,2:37:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你知道我永遠愛著你 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you know I’ll always love you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:58.16,2:38:00.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們還會再相見的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will see you again.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:01.47,2:38:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,儘管我希望那一天不要來得太快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I hope it’s not too soon.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:10.04,2:38:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界依然需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world still needs you.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:13.70,2:38:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,當然 他們永遠不會知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, they’ll never know it.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:16.00,2:38:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我們知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we do.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:20.36,2:38:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我們這些活在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We who live and die.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:23.31,2:38:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,陰影中的生死之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:26.80,2:38:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,本條資訊將在五秒後自毀\N{\fnArial\fs30}This message will self-destruct in five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:38:32.85,2:38:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好運 伊森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck, Ethan.
Dialogue: 0,2:42:32.26,2:42:37.48,Title,0,0,0,0,,[《碟中諜》主題曲響起]\N{\fnArial\fs30}[ Mission: Impossible theme playing]
